<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="MRK" style="id">- Lente Bible Translation</book>
  <para style="usfm">3.0</para>
  <para style="ide">65001 - Unicode (UTF-8)</para>
  <para style="h">MARKA</para>
  <para style="toc1">Marka Nganmi Jesuh Khrih ih Thuthangṭha</para>
  <para style="toc2">Marka</para>
  <para style="toc3">Mar</para>
  <para style="mt1">MARKA</para>
  <para style="mt2">Marka Nganmi Jesuh Khrih ih Thuthangṭha</para>
  <para style="imt">Thuhmaṭhi</para>
  <para style="im">Thukam Thar sungah Jesuh Khrih ih thuanthu ngankhummi cabu pali lakah <char style="bk">Marka Nganmi Jesuh Khrih ih Thuthangṭha</char> khaw hi a tel ve. Cuvai cabu pali pawl cu “thuthangṭha” tiah kawh an i. Jesuh ih thih hnukah Matthai, Marka, Luka le Johan pawl ih nganmi an i. Marka ih nganmi Thuthangṭha hi thuthangṭha cabu pali lakah a tawibik mi cabu a i. Thuthangṭha cabu pali lakah Marka ih nganmi Thuthangṭha hi hmasabik ih nganmi a i ih Khrih ih suah hnuk kum 65–70 karlak hrawngah nganmi a i, tiah zupnak a um. Rome khua ih a ummi Khristian pawl thazang pek ding tumtahnak thawn, Rome khua ah nganmi a i thok tiah Baibal thiam tamngai nih zupnak an nei.</para>
  <para style="ip">Marka hi Johan Marka tiakhaw an ko ih forhthlah Paul le Barnabas pawl thawn rualpi fa an i ih mission ṭuanṭuan in khual khaw an tlawn khat. Asinain an khualtlawnnak lamlak in Marka nih a kir ta hnei (<char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 13:13">Forh 13.13</ref></char>). Neta ah, Barnabas thawn khual an tlawn khat leh sal (<char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 15:37-39">Forh 15.37–39</ref></char>). Cun Marka hi Peter thawn khaw rualpi ṭha an i (<char style="xt"><ref loc="1PE 5:13">1 Pet 5.13</ref></char>). Marka hi ama rori nih Jesuh hmutu le a thuzirhmi theitu a i lo na in, Peter ih zirhnak pawl a ngankhum colh ih cucu Thuthangṭha cabu a ngan theinak hrampi a si thok, tiah Baibal thiam pawl nih, zupnak an nei. Marka ih nganmi Thuthangṭha cabu sungah, Marka nih, dungthluntu sihnak le can neta thu thawn pehpar in Jesuh ih zirhmi pawl cu thupi ngai ih a nganmi cabu a i.</para>
  <para style="iot">Thutlangpi</para>
  <para style="io1">1. Thuthangṭha hramthoknak <char style="ior">(<ref loc="MRK 1:1-13">1.1–13</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">2. Cule, Marka nih Jesuh Galilee a um lai ih a ṭuanṭuannak a ngan <char style="ior">(<ref loc="MRK 1:14-8:21">1.14—8.21</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">3. Cun, Marka nih Jerusalem ih Jesuh khualtlotnak a sim <char style="ior">(<ref loc="MRK 8:22-10:52">8.22—10.52</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">4. Marka nih Jesuh ih thihnak le thawhsalnak pawl tel in, Jerusalem ih a um lai thuhla thawn a ne ter <char style="ior">(<ref loc="MRK 11:1-16:8">11.1—16.8</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="ie" />
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="MRK 1" />
  <para style="s">Baptisma Petu Johan ih Thusipnak</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:1-12">Matthai 3.1–12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:1-18">Luka 3.1–18</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:19-28">Johan 1.19–28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 1:1" />Pathian Fapa,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">A hrekkhat kutngan cabu pawl sungah cu </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Pathian Fapa, </char><char style="ft" closed="false">a um lo.</char></note> Jesuh Khrih ih Thuthang Ṭha ih hramthawhnak cu hitih in a si. <verse eid="MRK 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 1:2" />Profet Isaiah ih nganmi mangin:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 1:2">“ ‘Zohhnik, na hmai ah ka palai ka thlah thok,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 1:2">Ani nih na zalam a timtuah thok.’<verse eid="MRK 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 1:3" />Ramṭhing ih mi pakhat hehnak aw nih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 1:3">‘Bawipa ih zalam timtuah uh;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 1:3">A zalam cu dingter uh,’ a ti.”<verse eid="MRK 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 1:4" />Baptisma petu Johan cu ramṭhing la in a ban ih, sual ngaihthiamnak hrangah sirfaknak baptisma thu a sim.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.4 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Baptisma petu Johan cu ramṭhing la in a ban ih, sual ngaihthiamnak hrangah sirfaknak baptisma thu a sim; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ihmi hi a hrekkhat kutngan cabu pawl sungah cu </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Johan cu ramṭhing in a ban ih thu a sim, </char><char style="ft" closed="false">tiah a um.</char></note> Ani nih mipi pawl sinah, “Nan sual sir uh la baptisma la uh. Cun Pathian nih nan sual pawl nan ta ngaihthiam thok,” tiah a ti. <verse eid="MRK 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 1:5" />Cun Judea peng pumpi le Jerusalem mi zate pawl cu a sinah an feh. An sualnak pawl an phuang ih Johan hmangin Jordan tikua ah baptisma an co.<verse eid="MRK 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 1:6" />Johan cu kalauk hmul ih tuahmi hnipuan a hru ih a tai ah saphaw taikap a kap. Cun khabawk le hramlak khuailawti cu caw ah a ei. <verse eid="MRK 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 1:7" />Cun, a thusipmi cu, “Ka dungih a tiang dingmi pa hi kei nakin a picang sawn, a hmai ah kun pit in a kedap hri phoihsaktu ding hmanah kei cu ka tlak lo. <verse eid="MRK 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 1:8" />Kei cu ti in baptisma nan ta pe; asinain ani cu Thlarau Thianghlim thawn baptisma nan ta pe thok,” tiah a i.<verse eid="MRK 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesuh ih Baptisma le Tukforhnak</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:13-4:11">Matthai 3.13—4.11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:21-22">Luka 3.21–22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:1-13">4.1–13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 1:9" />Cuvai ni ah Jesuh cu Galilee peng Nazareth khua in a ban ih Johan hmangin Jordan tikua ah baptisma a la. <verse eid="MRK 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 1:10" />Cun Jesuh cu ti sungih a hang suah cangka in van a hong fa ih Thlarau cu thute mangin a tlunih a rong ṭum cu a hmu. <verse eid="MRK 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 1:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 3:17">Mat 3.17</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 12:18">12.18</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:7">Mar 9.7</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:22">Luk 3.22</ref></char></note>Cun van in aw pakhat nih, “Nang cu ka duhdawt ngaimi ka Fapa na si, na cungah ka lung a kim setak,” tiah a ti.<verse eid="MRK 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 1:12" />Hmakhatte ah Thlarau nih Jesuh cu ramṭhing ah a ṭhita. <verse eid="MRK 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 1:13" />Cun cuvai hmun ah ni sawmli a um ih Seihtan nih a tukforh. Ramsa pawl thawn an um ih vancungmi pawl nih an tuamhlawm.<verse eid="MRK 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesuh nih Nga Tlaitu Pali A Ko</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:12-22">Matthai 4.12–22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:14">Luka 4.14</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 4:15">15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:1-11">5.1–11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 1:14" />Johan thawng an thlak hnukah Jesuh cu Galilee peng ah a feh ih Pathian ih Thuthang Ṭha a sim. <verse eid="MRK 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 1:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 3:2">Mat 3.2</ref></char></note>Jesuh nih, “Tikcu a kim i ih Pathian uknak a nai i! Nan sual sir u la Thuthang Ṭha cu zum uh!” tiah a sim.<verse eid="MRK 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 1:16" />Jesuh cu Galilee Tili kap ih a feh laiah, Simon le a unaupa Andru cu nga tlaitu an ih ruangah, tili sungah sur an vorh berbo lai a hmu hnei. <verse eid="MRK 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 1:17" />Cun Jesuh nih an sinah, “Ka thlun uh, cule minung tlaitu ah nan ta tuah thok,” tiah a ti hnei. <verse eid="MRK 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 1:18" />Hmakhatte ah an ni nih an sur pawl an ramta ih a dung an thlun.<verse eid="MRK 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 1:19" />Cun Jesuh cu a hlat deuhnak ah a feh ih, Zebedi ih fapa James le a unaupa Johan lawng sungih an sur pawl an rep berbo lai a hmu hnei. <verse eid="MRK 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 1:20" />Hmakhatte ah Jesuh nih a ko hnei ih, an pa Zebedi cu an tlakfa pawl thawn lawng sungah an ramta ih a dung an thlun.<verse eid="MRK 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Thlarau Sia ih Molhmi Pa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 4:31-37">Luka 4.31–37</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 1:21" />Jesuh le a dungthluntu pawl cu Kapernaum khua ah an feh, a zingla Sabbath ni ah Jesuh cu Sinakok ah a lut ih thuzirh a thok. <verse eid="MRK 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 1:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 7:28">Mat 7.28</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 7:29">29</ref></char></note>A thuzirhmi ah an mang a bang, zangahtihle Daanthiam pawl mang i lo in, ani cu thuneitu pakhat mangin a zirh.<verse eid="MRK 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 1:23" />Cuvai can ah thlarau sia ih molhmi pa pakhat cu Sinakok sung ah a tiang ih, <verse eid="MRK 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 1:24" />“Nazareth mi Jesuh, zangtu ah kan na ṭul? Kan na siatsuah dingah maw na tiang? Hu na si tih ta fiah — nang cu Pathian ih mi Thianghlim Pakhat na si,” tiah a hek.<verse eid="MRK 1:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 1:25" />Cun Jesuh nih cupa cu, “Daite in um, cupa ih sung in suak!” tiah a tai.<verse eid="MRK 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 1:26" />Thlarau sia nih cupa cu thangai in a caihter ih thangngai a heh hnuk ah, cupa ih sung in a suak. <verse eid="MRK 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 1:27" />Cun an zatein an mangbang colh ih, “Aimang thil cu zangtih in a i? Zirhnak thar maw a i? Thlarau sia pawl hman thuneihnak thawn thu a pe hnei ih a thu an thlun!” tiah pakhat le pakhat an sutfa.<verse eid="MRK 1:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 1:28" />Cutin Jesuh ih thuhla cu hmakhatte ah Galilee peng zate ah a thang colh.<verse eid="MRK 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesuh nih Mi Tamngai A Damter</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:14-17">Matthai 8.14–17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:38-41">Luka 4.38–41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 1:29" />Jesuh cu Sinakok ih a suah cang in Simon le Andru teiʼ inn ah James le Johan thawn an lut. <verse eid="MRK 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 1:30" />Simon nupi ih nu cu khurhfah in a fak ih a it; Jesuh a tian cang in cuvai thu cu an sim lohli. <verse eid="MRK 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 1:31" />Jesuh cu a sin a va feh ih a kut in a han tho. A khurhfahnak cu a dam ih a tuamhlawm hnei.<verse eid="MRK 1:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 1:32" />Ni a pil ih simla a tian tikah, mi fak pawl le khawsia ih molhmi pawl hmahhmah cu Jesuh sinah an tianpit. <verse eid="MRK 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 1:33" />Cun an khawpawh in cuvai inn suahka hmai ah an hmuakkhawmfa. <verse eid="MRK 1:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 1:34" />Jesuh nih fahnak phunphun ih a fakmi pawl a damter, cule khawsia tamngai khaw a dawisuak hnei. Khawsia pawl cu ṭon a sian hnei lo; zangahtihle hutu a si tih an fiah.<verse eid="MRK 1:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Galilee ah Jesuh Thu A Sim</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 4:42-44">Luka 4.42–44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 1:35" />Zingmaw khawvang hlan ah Jesuh cu a tho ih inn leng ah a suak. Thawngṭhingnak hmun ah a feh ih thla a cam. <verse eid="MRK 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 1:36" />Simon le a rualpi pawl nih Jesuh cu an hrawl, <verse eid="MRK 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 1:37" />an hmuh tikah, “Mi hmahhmah nih ta hrawl eng,” tiah an sim.<verse eid="MRK 1:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 1:38" />Jesuh nih, “Khua kiangkap dang ah feh uh sing. Thu ka sim hnei thok. Zangahtihle cucu ka tiannaksan a i,” tiah a sawn hnei.<verse eid="MRK 1:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 1:39" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1.39 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 4:23">Mat 4.23</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 9:35">9.35</ref></char>
    </note>Cun Galilee peng hmahhmah ah a feh ih an sinakok pawl ah thu a sim ih khawsia pawl khaw a dawisuak.<verse eid="MRK 1:39" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesuh nih Miphar Pakhat A Damter</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:1-4">Matthai 8.1–4</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:12-16">Luka 5.12–16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 1:40" />Miphar pa pakhat cu Jesuh sin a feh ih, khuk bil in bopnak a hler ih, “na duh ah cu, ka na thiangter thei,”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.40 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">ka na thiangter thei: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Himang fahnak cu biaknak la ih hmuhdan ah mi thianglo ah ruah a i.</char></note> tiah a ti.<verse eid="MRK 1:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 1:41" />Jesuh nih a thinfak<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.41 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">thinfak; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">a hrekkhat kutngan cabu pawl sungah cu </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">thinsia, </char><char style="ft" closed="false">tiah a um.</char></note> ih a kut dawh pit in a tham. Cule a sinah, “Ta ka thianter ka duh, thiang i,” tiah a ti. <verse eid="MRK 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 1:42" />Hmakhatte ah a pharfah a dam ih a thiang. <verse eid="MRK 1:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 1:43" />Jesuh nih fak ngai in ralrinnak a pe ih a hlatnak ah a fehter lohli, <verse eid="MRK 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 1:44" />Cun a sinah, “Ngai hnik! Hutu sinah zangkhaw sim hlah. Cunakin puithiam sinah va feh cih la tak zohfel seh; mi hmahhmah nih na dam tihmi an fiahnak dingah Moses ih thupekmi mangin mithiang na sihnak dingah thawinak pe,” tiah thu a pe.<verse eid="MRK 1:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 1:45" />Sikhawsehla cupa cu a feh ih a damnak thu cu duhsah ngaiin a sim ih khawhra a thang. Curuangah Jesuh cu mi ih hmuhhngan in khaw sungah a lut thei i lo. Khaw lengah a um ih a sinah hmunzakip in mi nih an pha.<verse eid="MRK 1:45" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="MRK 2" />
  <para style="s">Jesuh nih Taksaze Pa A Fimdamter</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:1-8">Matthai 9.1–8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:17-26">Luka 5.17–26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 2:1" />Ni tawkfang a rei hnukah Jesuh cu Kapernaum khua ah a ban sal ih, inn ah a um tih thu cu mi nih an fiah. <verse eid="MRK 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 2:2" />Mi tamngai cu hmunkhat ah an hmuakkhawm fak ruangah khan lawng a um lo ih suahka hram tiangin mi an khat colh. Cun Jesuh nih an sinah thu a sim. <verse eid="MRK 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 2:3" />Minung pali nih taksaze pa cu an zawn fa ih Jesuh sinah an tian pit. <verse eid="MRK 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 2:4" />Mi an tam tuk ih Jesuh ih hram an tian pit thei lo ruangah Jesuh umnak zawn inn tlun khuh cu an bal; an bauh colh ih taksaze pa cu a tangthah thawn an ron ṭhum. <verse eid="MRK 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 2:5" />Jesuh nih an zupnak a hmuh tikah, taksaze pa sinah, “Ka fapa, na sual pawl cu ngaihthiam na i cem,” tiah a ti.<verse eid="MRK 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 2:6" />Cun cuvai hmun ih a to ve mi daanthiam hrekkhat pawl nih an thinlung te in, <verse eid="MRK 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 2:7" />“Zangruangah hivai pa cu aitin a ṭon? Pathian thangsiat a i. Pathian hrel lo hutu nih sual pawl a ngaihthiam thei?” tiah an ti.<verse eid="MRK 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 2:8" />Jesuh nih an thinlung te in himang thu an ruah cu hmakhatte ah a thlarau nih a fiah ih an sinah, “Zangruangah nan thinlung te in himang thu cu nan ruat? <verse eid="MRK 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 2:9" />‘Na sual pawl cu ngaihthiam na i cem,’ tih maw, ‘Hang tho la na tangthah la pitin feh,’ tih, khoitu sawn hi hivai taksaze pa sinah sip bai sawn? <verse eid="MRK 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 2:10" />Asinain Minung Fapa nih leitlun ah sual pawl ngaihthiam theinak thuneihnak a nei tih nan fiahnak dingah hihi tuah a i,” tiah a sim. Taksaze pa sinah, <verse eid="MRK 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 2:11" />“Na sinah ta sim, hang tho, na tangthah la piʼn na inn ah ṭin,” tiah a ti.<verse eid="MRK 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 2:12" />Cun taksaze pa cu a hang tho ih hmakhatte ah a tangthah la pitin an zate hmuhhngan ah a feh. Curuangah an zatein an mangbang tuk ih, “Aimang thil cu kan hmu kel lo,” tiah an ti ih Pathian an thangṭhat.<verse eid="MRK 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesuh nih Levi A Ko</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:9-13">Matthai 9.9–13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:27-32">Luka 5.27–32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 2:13" />Jesuh cu Galilee tili kam ah a va feh sal; mi tamngai a sinah an tiang ih thu a zirh hnei. <verse eid="MRK 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 2:14" />A feh pah ah Alfias ih fapa Levi cu a siahkhong zung sungih a to cu a hei hmu. Cun Jesuh nih, “Ka thlun,” tiah a ti. Levi cu a hang ding ih Jesuh cu a thlun.<verse eid="MRK 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 2:15" />Cun Jesuh cu Levi ih inn ah<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.15 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Levi ih inn ah; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">loleh </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">ani ih </char><char style="ft" closed="false">(Jesuh ih) inn ah.</char></note> caw a ei. Siahkhongtu pawl le misual pawl khaw Jesuh le a dungthluntu pawl thawn caw an ei khat. Minung an tamngai ih Jesuh cu an thlun. <verse eid="MRK 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 2:16" />Farasi mi daanthiam pawl nih Jesuh cu siahkhongtu pawl le misual pawl thawn caw an ei khat lai an hmuh tikah, a dungthluntu pawl sinah, “Zangruangah Jesuh cu siahkhongtu pawl le misual pawl thawn caw an ei khat?” tiah an ti.<verse eid="MRK 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 2:17" />Cun Jesuh nih a thei hnei ih an sinah, “Mi fimdam pawl nih sibawi an ṭul lo, mifak pawl kau nih an ṭul. Mi dingfel pawl ko dingah ka tiang lo, misual pawl ko dingah ka tiang,” tiah a let hnei.<verse eid="MRK 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Cawulhnak Thu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:14-17">Matthai 9.14–17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:33-39">Luka 5.33–39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 2:18" />Johan ih dungthluntu pawl le Farasi pawl cu caw an ul. Minung pawl cu Jesuh sin an feh ih, “Johan ih dungthluntu pawl le Farasi dungthluntu pawl cu caw an ul, zangruangah na dungthluntu pawl cu caw an ul ve lo?” tiah an sut.<verse eid="MRK 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 2:19" />Cun Jesuh nih an sinah, “Mo neitu an sinih a um laiah, mo lawmtu pawl caw an ul thok maw? Mopuai ah mo neitu an sinih a um sung cu caw an ul thei thok lo. <verse eid="MRK 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 2:20" />Asinain an sin in mo neitu laksak ni a tiang leh thok, cuvai ni ah caw an ul leh thok.<verse eid="MRK 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 2:21" />“Hutu khaw nih hnipuan hlun cu puanthan thar thawn a dap kel lo. A dap asihle a thar nih a hlun cu a duk thok ih hnem hlehhlo in a pat thok. <verse eid="MRK 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 2:22" />Cun hutukhaw nih sabitti thar cu thawl hlun sungah an se kel lo. An siah asihle sabitti thar nih thawl hlun cu a pak ter thok ih sabitti le a thawl cu an siat colh thok. Sabit ti thar cu thawl thar ah siah sawn thok a i,” tiah a let hnei.<verse eid="MRK 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sabbath Ni Thusuhnak</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:1-8">Matthai 12.1–8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:1-5">Luka 6.1–5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 2:23" />Sabbath ni ah Jesuh cu sangvut lo lakin a feh; cule a dungthluntu pawl cu an feh pah ah sangvut vui pawl cu an zut. <verse eid="MRK 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 2:24" />Cun Farasi pawl nih Jesuh sinah, “Zohhnik, Sabbath ni ah tuah lo dingah daan ih a khammi cu zangruangah na dungthluntu pawl nih an tuah?” tiah an ti.<verse eid="MRK 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 2:25" />Cun Jesuh nih an sinah, “David nih a rualpi pawl thawn ei ding nei lo in le cawṭam ih an um lai ah zang a tuah tihmi nan siar kel lo maw? <verse eid="MRK 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 2:26" />Puithiam lubik Abiathar sanah Pathian ih inn songah lut in, puithiam pawl kau ih ei ding tiah daan ih a sianmi sang cu David nih a ei ih a rualpi pawl khaw a pe hnei,” tiah a let hnei.<verse eid="MRK 2:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 2:27" />Cun Jesuh nih an sinah, “Sabbath cu minung hrangah tuahmi a i; minung hi Sabbath hrangah tuahmi a i lo. <verse eid="MRK 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 2:28" />Curuangah Minung Fapa cu Sabbath tlun khawah bawi a i,” tiah a ti hnei.<verse eid="MRK 2:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="MRK 3" />
  <para style="s">Kutze Pa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:9-14">Matthai 12.9–14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:6-11">Luka 6.6–11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 3:1" />Cun Jesuh cu Sinakok ah a lut sal ih, cuva ah kutze pa pakhat a um. <verse eid="MRK 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 3:2" />Mi hrekkhat nih Jesuh cu sual an puh theinak dingah, Sabbath ni ah cupa cu a damter thok maw damter thok lo tiah ṭhangai in an zoh. <verse eid="MRK 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 3:3" />Jesuh nih cuvai kutze pa cu, “Hang ding la, hmai ah va suak hnik,” tiah thu a pe. <verse eid="MRK 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 3:4" />Cun Jesuh nih an sinah, “Daan nih Sabbath ni ah thil ṭha tuah maw, thil ṭha lo tuah hi a kham? Mi nunnak run maw, thah hi a kham?” tiah a sut hnei.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 3:4">Asinain an dai ṭhipṭhep. <verse eid="MRK 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 3:5" />Cun Jesuh nih thinsia in a zoh hnei vivo ih an thinlung a ruh tuk ruangah a riah a se ngai. Cun cuvai kutze pa cu, “Na ban cu pharh,” tiah a ti. <verse eid="MRK 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 3:6" />Farasi pawl cu lengah an suak ih Herod ih milai pawl thawn Jesuh thah thei dan ding an relkhawm lohli.<verse eid="MRK 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tili Kap ih Miburpi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 3:7" />Jesuh cu a dungthluntu pawl thawn Galilee Tili ah an va feh; miburpi nih Jesuh cu an thlun. Anni cu Galilee peng, Judea peng, <verse eid="MRK 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 3:8" />Jerusalem khua, Idumea peng, Jordan tikua kiangkap, Tai-ar le Sidon khua kiangkap in a tiangmi pawl an i. Jesuh ih thil tuahmi pawl an theih ruangih a tiangmi pawl an i. <verse eid="MRK 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 3:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.9–10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 4:1">Mar 4.1</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:1-3">Luk 5.1–3</ref></char></note>Minung an tamtuk ih mipi pawl nih an pah lonak dingah lawng fate timlam sak cia dingin Jesuh nih a dungthluntu pawl cu a forh hnei. <verse eid="MRK 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 3:10" />Mifak tamngai a damter ruangah mifak pawl cu Jesuh tham ngah dingin an cuh fa deido. <verse eid="MRK 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 3:11" />Cun thlarau sia pawl nih Jesuh an hmuh cangcangin a hmai ah an bok ih, “Nang cu Pathian ih Fapa na si,” tiah an hek.<verse eid="MRK 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 3:12" />Cun Jesuh nih ama cu hutu a si tih khi mi an sip lonak dingah cuvai thlarau sia pawl cu ralrinnak a pe hnei.<verse eid="MRK 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesuh nih Forhthlah Hleinih A Hril</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:1-4">Matthai 10.1–4</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:12-16">Luka 6.12–16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 3:13" />Cun Jesuh cu tlang cungah a kai ih a duh mi pawl a sinah a ko hnei; cule a sinah an tiang. <verse eid="MRK 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 3:14" />Cun a sinih umtu dingah le thusimtu dingih a thlah hnei theinak dingah minung hleinih a hril. <verse eid="MRK 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 3:15" />Cule khawsia pawl dawisuah theinak thuneihnak khaw a pe hnei.<verse eid="MRK 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 3:16" />Cun minung hleinih a hril mi ih hmin pawl cu: Simon (Peter tiah hmin a sakmi), <verse eid="MRK 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 3:17" />Zebedi ih fapa James le a naupa Johan (Jesuh nih Boanerges tiah hmin a sak hnei, Khawhri ih fale tinak a i), <verse eid="MRK 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 3:18" />Andru, Filip, Bartholomeo, Matthai, Thomas, Alfias ih fapa James, Thaddaeus, Phunṭan Simon le, <verse eid="MRK 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 3:19" />Jesuh zuarthlaitu Judas Iskariot pawl an si.<verse eid="MRK 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesuh le Beelzebul</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:22-32">Matthai 12.22–32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:14-23">Luka 11.14–23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:10">12.10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 3:20" />Cun Jesuh cu inn ah a ṭin. Mipi cu a sinah an tiang sal sei ruangah Jesuh le a dungthluntu pawl cu caw hman an ei man lo. <verse eid="MRK 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 3:21" />Cuvai thu cu a innsungsang pawl nih an fiah ih, mi nih “Jesuh cu a aa i,” tiah an tih ruangah, Jesuh kilkhawi dingah an feh.<verse eid="MRK 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 3:22" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3.22 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 9:34">Mat 9.34</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 10:25">10.25</ref></char>
    </note>Jerusalem ih a tiangmi daanthiam pawl nih, “Hi pa hi Beelzebul ih luhhnawhmi a i. Khawsia uktu bawi ih thuneihnak thawn khawsia pawl a dawisuak,” tiah an ti.<verse eid="MRK 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 3:23" />Cun Jesuh nih a sinah a ko hnei ih tahṭhipnak hmangin thu a sim hnei, “Zangtin Seihtan nih Seihtan lala a dawisuak thei thok maw? <verse eid="MRK 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 3:24" />Ram pakhat cu ṭhenṭhek fa in ama le ma a dohfak ahcun, cuvai ram cu rei a ding thei thok lo. <verse eid="MRK 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 3:25" />Innsang pakhat cu ṭhenṭhek fa in ama le ma a dohfak ahcun, cuvai innsungsang cu rei a ding thei thok lo. <verse eid="MRK 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 3:26" />Cun Seihtan cu ama le ma do fa in a ṭhenṭhek fak a sih ahcun, rei a ding thei thok lo ih a siatral thok.<verse eid="MRK 3:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 3:27" />“Asinain thaṭha pa cu hri thawn an khih hmasak lo ahcun, hutukhaw nih a inn songah lut pit in a thil an laksak thei thok lo.<verse eid="MRK 3:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 3:28" />“Thutak in nan ta sim, minung pawl ih sualnak hmahhmah le zangmang midang thangsiatnak<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3.28 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">midang thangsiatnak; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">loleh </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Pathian thangsiatnak.</char></note> an ṭonmi pawl cu ngaihthiam an i thok. <verse eid="MRK 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 3:29" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 12:10">Luk 12.10</ref></char></note>Asinain hutukhaw Thlarau Thianghlim a thangsiattu cu ngaihthiam a i kel thok lo, zangahtihle kumkhua daih sualnak a tuah,” tiah a ti. <verse eid="MRK 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 3:30" />Zangruangah tih le “Hi pa hi thlarau thianglo a sungah a um,” tiah an tih ruangah a si.<verse eid="MRK 3:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesuh ih Nu le A Unau pawl</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:46-50">Matthai 12.46–50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:19-21">Luka 8.19–21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 3:31" />Cun Jesuh ih nu le a unau pawl cu an tiang, inn lengah an ding ih, Jesuh kawhsak dingah mi an forh. <verse eid="MRK 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 3:32" />Jesuh ih hramah minung tamngai an to ih an ni nih, “Zohhnik, na nu le, na naunu le, na naupa le pawl nih ta hrawl eng, inn leng ah an um,” tiah an ti.<verse eid="MRK 3:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 3:33" />Jesuh nih, “Ka nu le ka unau pawl cu hutu le an si?” tiah a sut hnei. <verse eid="MRK 3:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 3:34" />A hramih totu pawl cu a zoh hnei ih, “Ka nu le ka unau pawl cu hiva ah an um. <verse eid="MRK 3:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 3:35" />Hutu khaw sisehla Pathian ih duhnak a tuahtu hmahhmah cu ka nu le ka unau pawl an si,” tiah a ti.<verse eid="MRK 3:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="MRK 4" />
  <para style="s">Thlaici Vorhtu Tahṭhipnak</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:1-9">Matthai 13.1–9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:4-8">Luka 8.4–8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 4:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4.1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 5:1-3">Luk 5.1–3</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Jesuh cu Galilee Tili kap ah thuzirh a thok sal. A sinih a tiangtu minung an tam tuk ruangah, lawng sungah a lut ih a to. Mipi pawl cu tili kap leilung ah an um. <verse eid="MRK 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 4:2" />Cun tahṭhipnak pawl hmangin thu a zirh hnei ih, mipi pawl sinah:<verse eid="MRK 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 4:3" />“Ṭhangai in ngai uh! Thlaici vorhtu cu thlaici vorh dingah a feh. <verse eid="MRK 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 4:4" />Thlaici cu a vorh ih, a hrekkhat cu zalam tluan ah an ṭil ih vate pawl nih an ei. <verse eid="MRK 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 4:5" />Thlaici hrekkhat cu lung tamnak hmun ah an ṭil ih leilung a sah lo ruangah thlaici cu an kho lohli. <verse eid="MRK 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 4:6" />Asinain ni a hang suah tikah, ni nih a sat hnei ih an hram a thuk lo ruangah an rocar colh. <verse eid="MRK 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 4:7" />Thlaici hrekkhat cu hling lakah an ṭil. Hling cu a hang ṭhang ih thlaikho cu a khuh colh ruangah an vui thei lo. <verse eid="MRK 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 4:8" />Thlaici dang pawl cu leiram ṭhatnak ah an ṭil. An hang ṭhang ih a let sawmthum, a let sawmruk, a let zakhat tiangin an vui thei,” tiah a sim hnei.<verse eid="MRK 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 4:9" />Cun an sinah, “Theihnak naa a neitu nih thei seh,” tiah a ti.<verse eid="MRK 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tahṭhipnak pawl ih Tumtahmi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:10-17">Matthai 13.10–17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:9-10">Luka 8.9–10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 4:10" />Jesuh cu ama lawng a um laiah, a kiangkap um pawl le a dungthluntu hleinih pawl nih tahṭhipnak thu pawl an sut <verse eid="MRK 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 4:11" />Cun Jesuh nih an sinah, “Pathian Uknak thuthup cu nan sinah pek a i cem, asinain a leng mi pawl hrangah cu tahṭhipnak thawn sip a i, <verse eid="MRK 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 4:12" />curuangah,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 4:12">“ ‘An zoh ngelngo thok naʼn</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 4:12">an hmu thei thok lo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 4:12">An naa nih a thei thok naʼn</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 4:12">an fiahthiam thok lo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 4:12">Zangahtihle Pathian sin an kir sal thok ih</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 4:12">a ngaihthiam hnei pang thok,’ ” tiah a sim.<verse eid="MRK 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesuh nih Thlaici Vorhtu Tahṭhipnak A Simfiang</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:18-23">Matthai 13.18–23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:11-15">Luka 8.11–15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 4:13" />Cun Jesuh nih an sinah, “Hivai tahṭhipnak hi nan cingthiam lo maw? Aitih cun zangtin tahṭhipnak hmahhmah cu nan cingthiam thok? <verse eid="MRK 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 4:14" />Thlaici vorhtu nih Pathian thu a vorh. <verse eid="MRK 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 4:15" />Mi hrekkhat cu zalam tluan ih a ṭilmi thlaici mang an i. Thu cu an thei, asinain Seihtan a tiang lohli ih an sungih tuhmi thu cu a laksak hnei. <verse eid="MRK 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 4:16" />Cumangin a hrekkhat cu lung tamnak hmun ih a ṭilmi thlaici mang an i. Pathian thu an theih cangin lungawi ngai in an cohlang lohli. <verse eid="MRK 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 4:17" />Asinain anma ah hrilhhram an neih lo ruangah reilote kau a daih. Cun Pathian thu ruangih harsatnak le hremnak a tian tikah Pathian an phatsan. <verse eid="MRK 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 4:18" />Mi hrekkhat cu hling lakih a ṭilmi thlaici mang an i. Pathian thu cu an thei, <verse eid="MRK 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 4:19" />asinain leitlun nunnak thu ih donharnak, let duhnak le thil dang duhnak pawl nih, Pathian thu cu a khuh ruangah an vui thei lo. <verse eid="MRK 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 4:20" />Asinain mi hrekkhat cu leiram ṭhatnak ih a ṭilmi thlaici mang an i. Pathian thu cu an thei, an cohlang ih a let sawmthum, a let sawmruk, a let zakhat tiangin an vui thei,” tiah a ti.<verse eid="MRK 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kho ih Khuhmi Mei-inn</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 8:16-18">Luka 8.16–18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 4:21" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4.21 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 5:15">Mat 5.15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:33">Luk 11.33</ref></char>
    </note>Cun Jesuh nih an sinah, “Mei-inn cu kho tang le ihkhun tangah siah a i kel maw? Mei-inn vannak ah siah a i ko lo maw? <verse eid="MRK 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 4:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:26">Mat 10.26</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:2">Luk 12.2</ref></char></note>Zangahtihle phorh lo dingih thuhmi le lang nolhsal lo dingmi thuthup zangkhaw a um lo. <verse eid="MRK 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 4:23" />Theihnak naa a neitu nih thei seh,” tiah a ti.<verse eid="MRK 4:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 4:24" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4.24 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 7:2">Mat 7.2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:38">Luk 6.38</ref></char>
    </note>Cun Jesuh nih an sinah, “Nan theihmi thu hi ṭhaten ruat uh. Midang tahnak ih nan hmanmi mangin nan khaw tah nan i ve thok — cunakih tamsawn hman bet nan i thok. <verse eid="MRK 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 4:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 13:12">Mat 13.12</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 25:29">25.29</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:26">Luk 19.26</ref></char></note>Zangahtihle a neitu cu pek bet a i thok ih, a nei lo tu cu a neihsun hman laksak a i thok,” tiah a ti.<verse eid="MRK 4:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">A Ṭhangmi Thlaici Tahṭhipnak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 4:26" />Cun Jesuh nih, “Pathian Uknak cu, mi pakhat nih lo sungah thlaici a vorh ih, <verse eid="MRK 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 4:27" />ama cu zan ah a it ih sun ah a tho, cuvai lai ah thlaici cu ama ten a kho ih a ṭhang; zangah aitin a ṭhang thiam tih khaw a fiah lo. <verse eid="MRK 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 4:28" />A ma ten leilung nih a ṭhang ter ih a thei ter, hmasabik ah hnah no a cerh ter, cule a vui ter ih netabik ah a fang a um ter. <verse eid="MRK 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 4:29" />Asinain a vui a cut tikah, cawlak can a cut i ruangah, a tacin thawn a la lohli tu mang a i,” tiah a ti.<verse eid="MRK 4:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ṭangṭap Ci Tahṭhipnak</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:31-32">Matthai 13.31–32</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 13:34">34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 13:18-19">Luka 13.18–19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 4:30" />Cun Jesuh nih, “Pathian Uknak cu zangtu thawn kan tahṭhim thok? Asihlole zangtu tahṭhipnak hmangin kan sim thok? <verse eid="MRK 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 4:31" />Lo sungih vorhmi ṭangṭap ci mang a i. Ṭangṭap ci cu leitlun ih thlaici hmahhmah lakih a fate bik a i. <verse eid="MRK 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 4:32" />Ṭangṭap ci cu vorh a ih tikah, a hang ṭhang ih thlaihnah dang hmahhmah nakin a hnem sawn. Tlangṭek hnem ngaingai a nei ih van ih vate pawl nih bu khaw an sa,” tiah a ti.<verse eid="MRK 4:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 4:33" />An fiahthiam theinak dingah, Jesuh nih himang tahṭhipnak tamngai hmangin an sinah thu a sim. <verse eid="MRK 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 4:34" />Tahṭhipnak tello in an sinah thu a sim lo. Asinain anma lawng kau an um can ah, a dungthluntu pawl sinah zangtinkim a simfiang.<verse eid="MRK 4:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesuh nih Zil le Tisuar A Dai Ter</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:23-27">Matthai 8.23–27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:22-25">Luka 8.22–25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 4:35" />Cuvai ni simla a kim tikah, Jesuh nih a dungthluntu pawl sinah, “Tili khatla ralah feh u sing,” tiah a ti. <verse eid="MRK 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 4:36" />Cun mipi pawl cu an ramta; Jesuh cu lawng sungah a to cia ih an feh pit. Lawng dang pawl khaw cuva ah an um ve. <verse eid="MRK 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 4:37" />Cun zil fak ngai in a zuang ciamco ih tisuar nih lawng cu a siatsuah ruangah lawng cu ti in a khat. <verse eid="MRK 4:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 4:38" />Jesuh cu lawng mei laah a um ih tokheng tlun ah a ihhmul. Cun an ṭhang ih, “Sayapa, kan riaral colh thok hi poi na ti lo maw?” tiah an ti.<verse eid="MRK 4:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 4:39" />Jesuh cu a hang tho ih zil cu a tai, cule tisuar sinah, “Dai i! Um zirziar!” tiah thu a pe. Cun zil cu a zuang i lo ih a dai ṭhipṭhep. <verse eid="MRK 4:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 4:40" />Jesuh nih a dungthluntu pawl sinah, “Zangruangah aitluk lawmlam in nan ṭih? Zupnak nan nei rih lo maw?” tiah a ti hnei.<verse eid="MRK 4:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 4:41" />Cun an ṭih tuk lawmlam ih pakhat le pakhat, “Hi pa hi zangtumang minung zetzo a i si na, zil le tisuar hman nih a thu an ngai?” tiah an ti fa.<verse eid="MRK 4:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="MRK 5" />
  <para style="s">Jesuh nih Thlarau Sia ih Molhmi Pa A Damter</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:28-34">Matthai 8.28–34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:26-39">Luka 8.26–39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 5:1" />Cun Jesuh le a dungthluntu pawl cu Galilee tili khatla ral ih Gerasene ram an va ban. <verse eid="MRK 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 5:2" />Cun Jesuh cu lawng sung in a ṭum ih, thlarau sia ih molhmi pa pakhat cu thlan sung in suak pit in Jesuh sinah a tiang lohli. <verse eid="MRK 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 5:3" />Cuvai pa cu thlan lakih ummi a i. Hutu khaw nih thirhri hman in an khih thei lomi pa a si. <verse eid="MRK 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 5:4" />Ke khihnak hri le thirhri pawl thawn hma tamngai an khit na in cuvai hri pawl cu a catter hnei colh ih hutu khaw cuvai pa neh thei dingin an tha a ṭha lo. <verse eid="MRK 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 5:5" />Sun zan in thlan lak le tlang lakah a hek ih ama le ma khaw lung thawn a at fa.<verse eid="MRK 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 5:6" />Cun lam hla in Jesuh a hei hmuh tikah, a va zuang ih Jesuh ih hmai ah cun a khuk a bil. <verse eid="MRK 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 5:7" />Cun a aw neih patawp in a hek ih, “Cungnungbik Pathian ih Fapa, Jesuh! Nang le kei cu zangtu kan pehtlai fa? Pathian hmin in ta ka dil, ka hrem hram hlah!” tiah a ti. <verse eid="MRK 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 5:8" />(Zangahtihle Jesuh nih a sinah, “Nang thlarau sia, hi pa ih sung in suak!” tiah a tih takdah ruangah a si.)<verse eid="MRK 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 5:9" />Cun Jesuh nih, “Na hmin hu a si?” tiah a sut.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 5:9">Cuvai pa nih, “Ka hmin cu ‘Burpi’ a si — zangahtihle kan tam setak!” tiah a sawn. <verse eid="MRK 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 5:10" />Cun cuvai pa nih thlarau thianglo pawl cuvai ram in dawi hnei colh lo dingah Jesuh cu thungai thlak in a dil.<verse eid="MRK 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 5:11" />Culaifangah cuvai kiangkap tlanghmual hrial ah vok rual tamngai an tlang deido. <verse eid="MRK 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 5:12" />Cun thlarau thianglo pawl nih Jesuh sinah, “Vok rual sinah kan hei thlah, an sungah kan lut ter,” tiah an hler. <verse eid="MRK 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 5:13" />An hlerh mangin Jesuh nih a sian hnei. Thlarau thianglo pawl cu cuvai pa ih sungin an suak ih vok rual sungah an lut. Cun vok rual pawl — an zatein 2,000 hrawng — cu kak lakah an dawp ih tili sungah ṭil pit in an thi.<verse eid="MRK 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 5:14" />Vok kiltu pawl cu an va zuang ih, cuvai thuhla cu khawpi sung le ram sungah an than ciamco. Cun mipi pawl cu thil cangmi zoh dingah an va feh. <verse eid="MRK 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 5:15" />Mipi pawl cu Jesuh sin an va tiang. Thlarau sia “Burpi” ih molhmi pa cu hnipuan a hru ih a lungfim te in an va hmu, cule an ṭih. <verse eid="MRK 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 5:16" />Thlarau sia ih molhmi pa tlun ih thil cangmi le vok rual tlun ih thil cangmi a hmutu pawl nih cuvai thu cu mi an sim.<verse eid="MRK 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 5:17" />Cun mipi pawl nih Jesuh cu an ram in suak dingah an hler.<verse eid="MRK 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 5:18" />Cule Jesuh cu lawng sungih a luh tikah, thlarau sia ih luhhnawh dah mi pa nih a sinah um dingin a hler.<verse eid="MRK 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 5:19" />Asinain Jesuh nih a sian lo ih a sinah, “Inn ah va ṭin pit in na innsungsang pawl sinah, Bawipa nih na hrangah zangtluk thil maksak a tuah tihle zangtluk in na tlun ah thinfahnak a nei tih khi va sim hnei sawn,” tiah a forh.<verse eid="MRK 5:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 5:20" />Cun cuvai pa cu a va feh ih Jesuh nih a hrangih a tuahsak mi thuhla cu Dekhapolis ram sungah a sim. Cun mi hmahhmah an mang a bang.<verse eid="MRK 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jairas Fanu le Jesuh ih Puan A Thamtu Nu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:18-26">Matthai 9.18–26</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:40-56">Luka 8.40–56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 5:21" />Cun Jesuh cu tili khatla ral ah lawng thawn a feh sal. Jesuh ih hram ah minung tamngai an hmuakkhawm fa, cule Jesuh cu tili kam ah a si. <verse eid="MRK 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 5:22" />Cun sinakok uktu pawl lakih pakhat, a hmin ah Jairas tihmi pa a tiangih Jesuh a hmuh tikah a ke hram ah a bok ih, <verse eid="MRK 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 5:23" />thungai thlakin thinfak a dil, “Ka fanu te a thi i ngaingai thok. A dam ih a nun theinak dingah kan sinah tiangin ka fanu ih tlun ah na kut suang hram,” tiah a ti.<verse eid="MRK 5:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 5:24" />Cun Jesuh cu cuvai pa thawn an feh. Mipi tamngai nih an thlun ih Jesuh cu an pah pah deido.<verse eid="MRK 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 5:25" />Cuvai hmun ah kum hleinih sung thi-dok fahnak ih a faktu numi pakhat a um. <verse eid="MRK 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 5:26" />A neihmi hmahhmah ne kau in sibawi tamngai sinah a tuamhlawm fa cem naʼn dam hoi loʼn a bese deuhdeuh. <verse eid="MRK 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 5:27" />Cuvai nu cu Jesuh ih thuhla a thei ih mipi pawl lakin Jesuh cu a dung laʼn a thlun, cule Jesuh ih puan cu a tham. <verse eid="MRK 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 5:28" />Zangahtihle, “A puan tal ka tham ngah ahcun ka dam kau thok,” tiah a ti.<verse eid="MRK 5:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 5:29" />Hmakhatte ah a thi dokmi cu a dam ih a fahnak in damter a i cem tih khaw a taksa nih a fiah. <verse eid="MRK 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 5:30" />Jesuh cu a sung in a huham a suak tih a fiahfa lohli, cule mipi la ah a herfa ih, “Hutu nih ka puan nan tham?” tiah a sut hnei.<verse eid="MRK 5:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 5:31" />Cun a dungthluntu pawl nih a sinah, “Mipi pawl nih ta pah eng deido cu na hmu kau, zangtin ‘Hutu nih ka puan nan tham?’ na ti thiam,” tiah an let.<verse eid="MRK 5:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 5:32" />A puan thamtu fiah duh ah kiangkap pawl cu a zoh. <verse eid="MRK 5:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 5:33" />Asinain numi nu cu, a cung ih thil cangmi cu a fiah ih, ṭih le ṭhia pah in Jesuh ih ke hram ah a bok. Cule Jesuh sinah thudik zaten a sim colh. <verse eid="MRK 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 5:34" />Cun Jesuh nih a sinah, “Ka fanu, na zupnak nih ta damter cem, hnangamte in va feh la na fahnak in dam dah hram law,” tiah a ti.<verse eid="MRK 5:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 5:35" />Jesuh cu a ṭon ngelngo lai ah, sinakok uktu pa ih inn in mi an tiang ih, “Na fanu cu a thi cem. Zangruangah Sayapa cu na hnaihnok rih ngelngo?” tiah an ti.<verse eid="MRK 5:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 5:36" />Asinain Jesuh nih an ṭonmi cu zanghrel lo in<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5.36 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">zanghrel lo in; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">loleh </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">thei lo mang in.</char></note> sinakok uktu pa sinah, “Ṭih vai hlah, zum kau lai ci,” tiah a ti. <verse eid="MRK 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 5:37" />Jesuh nih Peter, James, le James ih naupa Johan hrello hutukhaw a dung thlun a sian hnei lo. <verse eid="MRK 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 5:38" />Sinakok uktu pa ih inn an va bat tikah, mipi pawl ṭap le aihram in an buai deido cu a va hmu hnei. <verse eid="MRK 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 5:39" />Cun inn songah a lut ih an sinah, “Zangruangah ṭap le aihram in nan buai deido? Hi nappang nute hi a thi lo pi — a ihhmul mi a i!” tiah a ti hnei.<verse eid="MRK 5:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 5:40" />Cun mipi pawl nih Jesuh cu an hnihsan. Cun Jesuh nih an zaten lengah a suak ter hnei colh. Nappang nu ih nu le pa le a ṭhit tak hneimi pawl thawn nappang nu ih umnak ah cun an lut. <verse eid="MRK 5:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 5:41" />Cun a kut in nappang nu cu a tlai ih, <char style="tl">“Talitha, koum!”</char> tiah a ti. A sullam cu “Nute, hang tho ta ti!” tinak a i.<verse eid="MRK 5:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 5:42" />Hmakhatte ah nappang nu a hang tho lohli ih a feh. (Zangahtihle cuvai nu cu kum hleinih mi a i.) Cucu an mang a bang taktak. <verse eid="MRK 5:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 5:43" />Cun Jesuh nih hi thu hi hukhaw fiah ter lo dingin khoh ngaiin thu a pe hnei ih cuvai nu ih ei dingah thil pakhat khat pek a forh hnei.<verse eid="MRK 5:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="MRK 6" />
  <para style="s">Nazareth ah Jesuh Cu Hnon A Tuar</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:53-58">Matthai 13.53–58</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:16-30">Luka 4.16–30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 6:1" />Jesuh cu cuvai hmun in a suahnak khua ah a feh ih a dungthluntu pawl nih an thlun. <verse eid="MRK 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 6:2" />Sabbath ni ah sinakok ah thu zirh a thok. A thuzirhmi a theitu mi tamngai cu an mang a bang ngai ih, “Hivai pa nih hi thil pawl hi khoituʼn a ngah? A sinih pekmi hivai fitnak hi zangtu fitnak a i? Zangtin himang mangbangza hi teh a kut in a tuah thiam? <verse eid="MRK 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 6:3" />Ani cu Mary ih fapa, James, Joses, Judas le Simon le pawl ih upa, lettama pa khi a si lo maw? A naunu le khaw hiva kan sinah an um ve i lo maw?” tiah an ti. Cun an ni le nih Jesuh cu an hnong.<verse eid="MRK 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 6:4" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6.4 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 4:44">Joh 4.44</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Cun Jesuh nih an sinah, “Profet cu ama ih khua le ram, a sungkhat pawl le a innsungsang hrello hmun dang ah cu an upat,” tiah a ti hnei.<verse eid="MRK 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 6:5" />Cun cuvai hmun ah cun mifak temte tlunah a kut a suang ih a damter; cuvai hrello mangbangza zangkhaw a tuah lo. <verse eid="MRK 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 6:6" />Cun an zuplonak ruangah Jesuh cu a mangbang.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="MRK 6:6">Jesuh nih Dungthluntu Hleinih A Thlah</para>
  <para style="r" vid="MRK 6:6">(<ref loc="MAT 10:5-15">Matthai 10.5–15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:1-6">Luka 9.1–6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:6">Cun a kaingkap khua pawl ah a feh ih thu a zirh. <verse eid="MRK 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 6:7" />Cule minung hleinih cu a ko hnei ih pa nih panih in a thlah hnei. Cun thlarau sia pawl tlunih thuneih theinak a pe hnei. <verse eid="MRK 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 6:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.8–11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 10:4-11">Luk 10.4–11</ref> </char></note>Cule an sinah, “Nan khualtlotnak ah fiangṭhulh hrello zangkhaw keng hlah uh — caw i seh, khualtlotnak zal i seh, paisa bawm sungah paisa i seh, keng hlah uh. <verse eid="MRK 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 6:9" />Kedap cu hru uh, asinain angki hlei keng hlah uh,” tiah thu a pe hnei. <verse eid="MRK 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 6:10" />Cun an sinah, “Inn sung nan luh cangcang in, nan feh sal hlan lo cuvai inn ah nan cam thok. <verse eid="MRK 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 6:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 13:51">Forh 13.51</ref></char></note>Cun riah-inn nan ta cohlang lo ih nan thu nan ta ngai lo tu khua cu, an khua nan suah tak tikah, anma dokalhnak fiahpittu ah, nan ke ih leivut cu thingta uh,” tiah a ti hnei.<verse eid="MRK 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 6:12" />Curuangah an feh ih sirfaknak ding thu an phuang. <verse eid="MRK 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 6:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JAS 5:14">Jam 5.14</ref></char></note>Khawsia tamngai an dawi suak ih mifak tamngai khaw hriak an culh ih an damter.<verse eid="MRK 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Baptisma Petu Johan ih Thihnak</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:1-12">Matthai 14.1–12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:7-9">Luka 9.7–9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 6:14" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6.14–15 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 16:14">Mat 16.14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:28">Mar 8.28</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:19">Luk 9.19</ref></char>
    </note>Jesuh ih hmin a than tuk ruangah Siangpahrang Herod<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6.14 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Siangpahrang Herod: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Herod Antipas, Galilee uktu.</char></note> nih Jesuh ih thuhla cu a thei ve. Mi hrekkhat nih, “Baptisma petu Johan cu thihnak in a thosal. Curuangah hi mangbangza thil pawl tuahtheinak huham cu Jesuh sinah ṭuan a ṭuan i thok,” tiah an ti.<verse eid="MRK 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 6:15" />Mi dang pawl nih, “Elijah a si,” tiah an ti.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:15">Asinain mi dang pawl sei nih, “Profet a i, a sih lole profet pawl lakih pakhat khat mang a i,” tiah an ti.<verse eid="MRK 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 6:16" />Asinain Herod nih cuvai thu a theih ve tikah, “A hngawng ka ṭhawh termi Johan a si kau, thihnak in a thosal si lai tu!” tiah a ti. <verse eid="MRK 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 6:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.17–18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 3:19">Luk 3.19</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 3:20">20</ref> </char></note>Zangahtihle Herod ama rori nih a naupa Filip ih nupi Herodias ruangah mi a thlah ih Johan cu a tlai ter hnei, cule hri thawn khit pit in thawng thla dingin thu a pek dahmi a i. Zangruangah tih le Herod nih a nau pa Filip ih nupi Herodias cu nupi ah a ṭhit ruangah a i. <verse eid="MRK 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 6:18" />Zangahtihle Johan nih Herod sinah, “Na naupa ih nupi na ṭhit cu daan nih a duh lo,” tiah a tih tak dah ruangah a i.<verse eid="MRK 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 6:19" />Curuangah Herodias nih Johan cu a mit a kem ih thah a duh; Asinain a that thei lo. <verse eid="MRK 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 6:20" />Zangruangah tih le Johan cu mi dingfel le mi thianghlim a i tih Herod nih a fiah ruangah a ṭih ih a hum. Herod nih Johan ih thu a theih tikah, thin buai ngai in a um, cule a thusipmi cu lungawi ngai in ngai a duh thotho.<verse eid="MRK 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 6:21" />Cun Herod nih a suahni lopnak ah bawi upa pawl, ralbawi pawl le Galilee peng ih upa pawl hrangah zanriah ei khatnak puai a tuah ih, Herodias cu tikcu remcang a ngah. <verse eid="MRK 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 6:22" />Herodias ih fanu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6.22 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Herodias ih fanu; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">a hrekkhat kutngan cabu pawl sungah cu </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Ama ih fanu Herodias, </char><char style="ft" closed="false">tiah a um.</char></note> cu a rong lut ih a lam, Herod le a mikhual pawl cu an lung a awi ngai. Cun Siangpahrang pa nih numi nute sinah cun, “Na duhmi hmahhmah cu ka hler la ta pe thok,” tiah a ti. <verse eid="MRK 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 6:23" />Cun cuvai nute sinah, “Ka na hlerhmi poh cu ta ka pe thok, ka ram a hrek tiang khaw ta pe thok!” tiah siatti dingin thu a kam.<verse eid="MRK 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 6:24" />Cun cuvai nute cu a feh ih a nu sinah, “Zangtu ka hler thok?” tiah a sut.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:24">Cun a nu nih, “Baptisma petu Johan ih lu,” tiah a ti.<verse eid="MRK 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 6:25" />Cun cuvai nu cu zamrang ngai in siangpahrang pa sinah a feh lohli ih, “Baptisma petu Johan ih lu cu kheng thawn in ka pe lohli la ka duh,” tiah a hler.<verse eid="MRK 6:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 6:26" />Cun siangpahrang pa cu a riah a se ngai, asinain siatti dingin thu a kam cem ruangah le a mikhual pawl ruangah cuvai nu ih hlerhmi cu a el thei lo. <verse eid="MRK 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 6:27" />Siangpahrang pa nih mithattu a thlah lohli ih Johan ih lu la dingin thu a pe. Cuvai pa cu thawnginn songah a va feh ih Johan ih lu cu a va tan. <verse eid="MRK 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 6:28" />Cun Johan ih lu cu kheng thawn a keng ta ih numi nute cu a pe. Cule numi nute nih a nu sinah a pe. <verse eid="MRK 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 6:29" />Cuvai thu cu Johan ih dungthluntu pawl nih an fiah tikah, an feh ih a ruak cu an la, cule thlan ah an phum.<verse eid="MRK 6:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesuh nih Mi 5,000 Caw A Dar</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:13-21">Matthai 14.13–21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:10-17">Luka 9.10–17</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:1-14">Johan 6.1–14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 6:30" />Cun a forhthlah pawl cu Jesuh sinah an hmuakkhawm fa ih an tuahmi hmahhmah le an zirhmi hmahhmah cu a zaten an sim. <verse eid="MRK 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 6:31" />Cun ani nih an sinah, “Ram ṭhing ah nanma thawn hlang kan feh thok ih kan va cawlhnga thok,” tiah a ti hnei. Zangahtihle mi lut suak an tamtuk ruangah caw ei can rori hman an nei lo. <verse eid="MRK 6:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 6:32" />Cun ramṭhing la ah anma hlang lawng thawn an feh.<verse eid="MRK 6:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 6:33" />Mipi pawl nih an pawh lai cu an hmu ih hutu le an si tih an fiah tikah khua cangcang in ke thawn an zuang. Cule Jesuh le a dungthluntu pawl ih bat hlan ah an ban. <verse eid="MRK 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 6:34" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 9:36">Mat 9.36</ref></char></note>Jesuh cu lawng sungin a suah tikah, miburpi cu a hmu hnei, cule khaltu nei lo tuu mang an ih ruangah a thinfak hnei. Cule thu tamngai a zirh hnei. <verse eid="MRK 6:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 6:35" />Cun ni a sim i tikah, a dungthluntu pawl cu Jesuh sinah an feh ih, “Hi hmun hi ram ṭhing a i, ni le a sim ngai i cem. <verse eid="MRK 6:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 6:36" />Mipi pawl hi, kiangkap ih lo le khua pawl ah thlah hnei la, ei ding thil zangtumaw tal leih fa seu,” tiah an ti.<verse eid="MRK 6:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 6:37" />Asinain Jesuh nih, “Ei ding cu nan nih pe uh,” tiah a sawn hnei.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:37">Cun an ni nih, “Ngun tangka<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6.37 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Ngun tangka: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ngun tangka hi Grik in denarius tiah an ti. Ngun tangka fangkhat cu mi pakhat ih ni khat hlawhman a i (</char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 20:2">Mat 20.2</ref></char> ah zoh).</note> 200 man in caw lei pit in mipi pawl hi kan pe thok maw?” tiah an sut.<verse eid="MRK 6:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 6:38" />Cule ani nih an sinah, “Sang hlawm khawzat nan nei? Feh uhla zoh uh,” tiah a ti hnei.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:38">Cun an va zoh ih, “Sang hlawm nga le nga panih,” tiah an ti.<verse eid="MRK 6:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 6:39" />Cule a dungthluntu pawl sinah, mipi pawl cu ta hring tlun ah a bur a bur in to ter dingah, thu a pe hnei. <verse eid="MRK 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 6:40" />Curuangah mipi pawl cu zakhat bur, sawmnga bur tin an to. <verse eid="MRK 6:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 6:41" />Cun sang hlawm nga le nga panih cu a la ih, van la zoh in lungawithu a sim. Cule sang cu a seu ih mipi pawl zem dingah a dungthluntu pawl sinah a pe. Cun nga panih khaw cu an zate sinah a zem. <verse eid="MRK 6:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 6:42" />Cule an zaten an ei ih an khop ngai. <verse eid="MRK 6:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 6:43" />An hlahmi nga le sang nepnawi pawl cu a dungthluntu pawl nih an sar ih khoto hleinih a khat in an sar. <verse eid="MRK 6:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 6:44" />Cuvai sang eitu pawl cu pami hlang ah 5,000 an i.<verse eid="MRK 6:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ti Tlun ah Jesuh A Feh</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:22-33">Matthai 14.22–33</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:15-21">Johan 6.15–21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 6:45" />Jesuh nih mipi pawl a tlun ter hnei laiah, tili ral ih Bethsaida khua ah feh khan dingin a dungthluntu pawl cu hmakhatte ah lawng sungah a lut ter hnei. <verse eid="MRK 6:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 6:46" />Cun Jesuh cu mipi pawl tlun hnukah, thla cam dingin tlang tlunah a kai. <verse eid="MRK 6:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 6:47" />Cun ni a sim i tikah, lawng cu tili laifang ah a um ih Jesuh cu tili kam ah ama kau a um. <verse eid="MRK 6:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 6:48" />Zil cu anma la ah a zuan ruangah, a dungthluntu pawl cu harsa ngaiin lawng an to cu a hmu hnei. Curuangah zingmaw khawvang hlan hrawngah tili tlunin an sinah a feh. An sin a tian tikah lattak<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6.48 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">lattak hnei; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">loleh </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">kop hnei.</char></note> hnei a tum. <verse eid="MRK 6:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 6:49" />Cun ti tlunih a feh cu an hmuh tikah, muthla ah an tih ih an hek ciamco. <verse eid="MRK 6:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 6:50" />Zangahtihle an zaten an hmu ih an ṭih tuk.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:50">Asinain hmakhatte ah Jesuh nih an sinah, “Thinphang hlah uh, kei ka si, ṭih hlah uh,” tiah a ti hnei. <verse eid="MRK 6:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 6:51" />Cun a dungthluntu pawl sin lawng sungah a lut ih zil cu a dai. Cun dungthluntu pawl cu an mang a bang ngai. <verse eid="MRK 6:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 6:52" />Zangahtihle an lung a ruh tuk ruangah mi 5,000 caw a darmi ih a tih duhsatnak khaw an fiahthiam lo.<verse eid="MRK 6:52" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesuh Nih Gennesaret ah Mifak A Damter</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:34-36">Matthai 14.34–36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MRK 6:53" />Cun tili an tan ngah tikah Gennesaret ah an ban, cule an lawng cu tikap ah an khit. <verse eid="MRK 6:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MRK 6:54" />Lawng sung in an ṭum tikah, mipi pawl nih Jesuh cu an fiah thiam lohli. <verse eid="MRK 6:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MRK 6:55" />Cun cuvai ram kiangkap pawl hmahhmah ah an zuang ih, Jesuh a um tih an fiahnak hmun cangcang ah mifak pawl cu an ihnak tangthah thawn an tian pit. <verse eid="MRK 6:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MRK 6:56" />Cun Jesuh ih fehnak hmun khawte cang ah iseh, khawpi cang le lo tiangah khaw iseh, mifak pawl cu dawr hmun ah an tian pit. Jesuh ih hnipuan zimte tal tham ter dingah an hler. Cule a tham ngahtu hmahhmah cu an dam.<verse eid="MRK 6:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="MRK 7" />
  <para style="s">Pupa pawl ih Thuzirhmi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 15:1-9">Matthai 15.1–9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 7:1" />Cun Jerusalem in a tiangmi Farasi pawl le daanthiam hrekkhat pawl cu Jesuh ih hram ah an hmuakkhawmfa. <verse eid="MRK 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 7:2" />Cule Jesuh ih dungthluntu hrekkhat pawl cu an kut hnawm pi in caw an ei khi an hmu — cucu an kut an ṭawlfa lo, tinak a i.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 7:2">( <verse eid="MRK 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 7:3" />Zangahtihle Farasi pawl le Judah mi hmahhmah nih, an pupa pawl ih dun le daan khoh ngai in an thlun ruangah, kut ṭawlfa loʼn caw an ei lo. <verse eid="MRK 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 7:4" />Cun dawr in an tlun tik khawah kholhfa hmasak loʼn zangkhaw an ei lo.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7.4 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">dawr in an tlun tik khawah kholhfa hmasak loʼn zangkhaw an ei lo; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">loleh </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">dawr ih an lei mi hmahhmah khaw ṭawl hmasak loʼn an ei lo.</char></note> Cule an pupa pawl ih dun le daan pawl: khuat ṭawl dan, khukheng ṭawl dan le ihkhun pawl<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7.4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">A hrekkhat kutngan cabu pawl sungah cu </char><char style="fq" closed="false">le ihkhun pawl; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">a tel lo.</char></note> thianfaih dan tivek pawl khaw an thlun.)<verse eid="MRK 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 7:5" />Cun Farasi pawl le daanthiam pawl nih Jesuh cu, “Zangruangah na dungthluntu pawl hi kan pupa pawl ih dun le daan thlun loʼn, kut hnawm pi thawn caw an ei?” tiah an sut.<verse eid="MRK 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 7:6" />Cun Jesuh nih an sinah, “Profet Isaiah nih, nan mitifater pawl ih thuhla a sip mi cu a dik taktak. Hitin a ngan:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 7:6">“ ‘Hi minung pawl nih an hmurka kau in ka na upat,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 7:6">Asinain an thinlung cun ka na hlat.<verse eid="MRK 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 7:7" />Kei ka na biaknak cu a lakmen a i,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 7:7">minung ih daan pawl cu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 7:7">Pathian ih thurin mangin an zirh.’<verse eid="MRK 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 7:8" />“Pathian ih thupek cu nan ram ih minung ih dun le daan sawn nan thlun.”<verse eid="MRK 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 7:9" />Cun Jesuh nih an sinah, “Nan zirhsinmi dun le daan hngetkhoh dingah Pathian ih thupek sawn cu nan hnong. <verse eid="MRK 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 7:10" />Zangahtihle Moses nih, ‘Nan nu le nan pa cu upat uh,’ cule, ‘A nu le pa ṭonsia ih a be tu cu thah tengteng thok a i,’ tiah a ti. <verse eid="MRK 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 7:11" />Asinain nan nih cu, ‘Mi pakhat khat nih a nu le a pa hrangah thil ṭha pakhat khat nei na kau in “Korban a tih” a sih ahcun (Korban tihmi cu Pathian sinih pekhlanmi tinak a i), <verse eid="MRK 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 7:12" />cuvai pa cu a nu le pa zohkhentu sihnak in a luat,’ tiah nan ti. <verse eid="MRK 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 7:13" />Nan zirhsinmi nan dun le daan hmangin, Pathian ih thu cu zanghmanlo ah nan tuah. Cule cuvai mang thil tamngai khaw nan tuah,” tiah a ti.<verse eid="MRK 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Minung Hnawm Tertu Thil pawl</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 15:10-20">Matthai 15.10–20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 7:14" />Cun Jesuh nih mipi pawl cu a ko hnei sal ih an sinah, “Nan zaten ka ngai uhla cing uh. <verse eid="MRK 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 7:15" />Lengla in sungla ih a lutmi thil pawl nih minung hi a hnawmter lo; Asinain sungla in a suakmi thil pawl nih a hnawmter sawn,” tiah a ti hnei. <verse eid="MRK 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" pubnumber="[16]" sid="MRK 7:16" /><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7.16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">A hrekkhat kutngan cabu pawl sungah cu afate 16: </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">cule, na nan neih ah cu ngai uh! </char><char style="ft" closed="false">tiah an bet (</char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MRK 4:23">4.23</ref></char> zoh).</note><verse eid="MRK 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 7:17" />Jesuh cu mipi pawl ramta hnei pit in inn song a luh tikah, a dungthluntu pawl nih cuvai tahṭhipnak thu cu an sut. <verse eid="MRK 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 7:18" />Jesuh nih an sinah, “Zangtin nan khaw nan cing ve cuang lo maw? Lengla in a lut mi zangtu thil khaw nih minung a hnawmter lo, <verse eid="MRK 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 7:19" />zangahtihle cuvai thil cu a thinlung sungah a lut lo ih, a pumpi sungah a lut sawn. Cule ekinn ah a suak colh sal, tih nan fiah lo maw?” tiah a ti hnei. (Aitin a tihnak cu caw hmahhmah hi ei thiang a i, tiah a tih duhnak a i.)<verse eid="MRK 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 7:20" />Cun Jesuh nih, “Minung sungih a suakmi thil nih minung a hnawmter. <verse eid="MRK 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 7:21" />Zangahtihle minung sungla ih a suakmi ruahnak ṭha lo, nupa sual tuahnak, lolak hlah, lainawng, <verse eid="MRK 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 7:22" />ṭangṭawm sualnak, duhhamnak, sualralnak, mideu, taksa hiarnak, nahsuah iksiknak, midang thangsiatnak, puarthaunak, atthlakza thil tuahnak — <verse eid="MRK 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 7:23" />aivai thil ṭha lo hmahhmah cu minung sungin a suak ih, minung a hnawmter,” tiah a ti.<verse eid="MRK 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nucang Nu ih Zupnak</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 15:21-28">Matthai 15.21–28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 7:24" />Cun Jesuh cu cuvai hmun in a pok ih, Tai-ar khuapi hram la ah a feh. Cule inn pakhat sungah a lut ih hutukhaw ih an fiah ding a duh lo, asinain a thupfa thei cuang lo. <verse eid="MRK 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 7:25" />Zangahtihle a fanu khawsia ih luhhnawh mi ih nu, nucang pakhat nih Jesuh a um tih a fiah ih a sinah a feh, cule hmakhatte ah a ke hram ah a bok. <verse eid="MRK 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 7:26" />Nucang nu cu Zentail mi Fonisia rammi a i. Cuvai nu nih a fanu sungih khawsia dawisuak dingah Jesuh cu a hler. <verse eid="MRK 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 7:27" />Jesuh nih a sinah, “Fale nih khop ngai in ei hmasak seu. Zangahtihle fale ih caw laksak pit in uico pek cu a ṭha thok lo,” tiah a ti.<verse eid="MRK 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 7:28" />Asinain cuvai nucang nu nih, “A i hrim, Bawipa, fale ih caw tlawktlau cu cabuai tangih uico pawl nih ei ve kau hmah uh ee,” tiah a sawn.<verse eid="MRK 7:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 7:29" />Cun Jesuh nih cuvai nu sinah, “Hivai na ṭonkam ruangah, na feh thei i, na fanu sung in khawsia cu a suak cem,” tiah a ti.<verse eid="MRK 7:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 7:30" />Cun cuvai nu cu inn a bat tikah, a fanu cu ihkhun tlunah it in a hmu. Khawsia cu a suak cem taktak.<verse eid="MRK 7:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesuh nih Naset Ṭonthiamlo A Damter</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 7:31" />Cun Jesuh cu Tai-ar peng a ramta ih Sidon peng pal pah pit in Dekhapolis ram Galilee Tili ah a feh. <verse eid="MRK 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 7:32" />Cun naset le fiangngai ih ṭonthiamlo pa pakhat cu Jesuh sinah an tianpit. Cule cuvai pa ih tlunah a kut suang dingin Jesuh cu an hler. <verse eid="MRK 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 7:33" />Cun Jesuh nih cuvai pa cu mipi pawl lak in hmun dang deuh ah a ṭhita ih, cuvai pa ih naa sungah a zung in a von tok, a cihrit a kha, cule a lei a tham sak. <verse eid="MRK 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 7:34" />Cun van la zoh in a thawpi a suah ih, <char style="tl">“Ephphatha!”</char> tiah a ti. A sullam cu, “Hong fa seh!” tihnak a i.<verse eid="MRK 7:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 7:35" />Cun cuvai pa ih naa cu a theng ih a lei talh dawntu cu a poih, cule fiangngai in a ṭon suak thei. <verse eid="MRK 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 7:36" />Cun Jesuh nih mipi pawl cu hukhaw sim lo dingin thu a pe. Asinain a kham hnei tam deuhdeuh le tam sinsin in an sim. <verse eid="MRK 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 7:37" />Cun mipi pawl cu an khuaruah a har ngai ih, “Thil zangkim hi ṭha tuk in a tuah. Naset pawl cu an naa a theng ter ih ṭonthiamlo pawl khaw a ṭon ter,” tiah an ti.<verse eid="MRK 7:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="MRK 8" />
  <para style="s">Jesuh nih Mi 4,000 Caw A Dar</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 15:32-39">Matthai 15.32–39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 8:1" />Cuvai can ah, minung tamngai cu an hmuakkhawm fa seisei ih ei ding zangkhaw an neih lo tikah, Jesuh nih a dungthluntu pawl cu a ko hnei ih an sinah, <verse eid="MRK 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 8:2" />“Mipi pawl hi ka thinfak hnei tuk, zangahtihle ka sinah an umnak ni thum lai a rei i cem ih ei ding zangkhaw an nei lo. <verse eid="MRK 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 8:3" />Zangkhaw ei lo in ka tlun ter hnei asihle, lam lakah an caw ṭam in an ba colh thok. Zangahtihle mi hrekkhat cu lam hlapi in a tiangmi an i,” tiah a ti hnei.<verse eid="MRK 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 8:4" />Cun a dungthluntu pawl nih, “Aimang ramṭhing lakah hutu nih minung hi zat hrangah caw a hrawl thei thok?” tiah an sawn.<verse eid="MRK 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 8:5" />Jesuh nih an sinah, “Sang hlawm khawzat nan nei?” tiah a sut hnei.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 8:5">Cule an ni nih, “Hlawm sarih,” tiah an ti.<verse eid="MRK 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 8:6" />Cun Jesuh nih mipi pawl cu leilung ah to dingin thu a pe hnei. Cule sang hlawm sarih cu a la ih lungawithu a sip hnukah, a seu ih mipi pawl zem dingah a dungthluntu pawl sinah a pe. Cule an ni nih mipi pawl cu an zem. <verse eid="MRK 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 8:7" />Nga fate te khaw temte an nei. Lungawithu a sip hnukah mipi pawl zem thotho dingin thu a pe hnei. <verse eid="MRK 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 8:8" />Cun mipi pawl cu an ei ih an khop ngai. Cule an hlahmi nepnawi pawl cu an sar sal ih kho sarih khat an sar. <verse eid="MRK 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 8:9" />Cun a eitu mipi pawl cu 4,000 hrawng an i. Jesuh cu mipi pawl a tlunter hnei. <verse eid="MRK 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 8:10" />Cule hmakhatte ah a dungthluntu pawl thawn lawng sung ah an lut ih Dalmanutha peng ah an feh.<verse eid="MRK 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Farasi pawl nih Hmuhsaknak Tuah An Hler</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:38-42">Matthai 12.38–42</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 16:1-4">16.1–4</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 8:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8.11 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 12:38">Mat 12.38</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:29">Luk 11.29</ref></char>
    </note>Cun Farasi pawl cu an tiang ih Jesuh thawn thu-el fak an thok. Jesuh hneksaknak dingah, vancung ihsin hmuhsaknak tuah an hler. <verse eid="MRK 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 8:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8.12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 12:39">Mat 12.39</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:29">Luk 11.29</ref> </char></note>Asinain Jesuh cu a thawpi a suah ih, “Zangruangah tun san minung pawl hi hmuhsaknak nan hrawl? Thutakin nan ta sim, tun san minung pawl sinah zangtu hmuhsaknak khaw pek an i thok lo,” tiah a ti.<verse eid="MRK 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 8:13" />Cule Jesuh cu a feh ta hnei ih lawng sungah a lut. Cun tili khatla ralah a feh.<verse eid="MRK 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Farasi le Herod ih Colh</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:5-12">Matthai 16.5–12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 8:14" />Cun dungthluntu pawl nih sang kentak an hmulh ih lawng sungah cun sang hlawm khat kau an nei. <verse eid="MRK 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 8:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8.15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 12:1">Luk 12.1</ref> </char></note>Cule Jesuh nih an sinah, “Farasi pawl ih colh le Herod ih colh hi ralring lau cih,” tiah a cah hnei.<verse eid="MRK 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 8:16" />Cule “sang kan neih lo ruangah aitin kan na ti si na pan,” tiah pakhat le pakhat an ti fa.<verse eid="MRK 8:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 8:17" />Jesuh nih an ṭonmi a thei hnei ih, an sinah, “Sang nan neih lo thu cu zangah nan rel ngelngo? Nan cing thiam lo maw, nan fiahfiang lo? Nan lung a ruh rih maw? <verse eid="MRK 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 8:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8.18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 4:12">Mar 4.12</ref></char></note>Mit nei hmah pit in — nan hmu lo maw? Naa nei hmah pit in — nan thei lo maw? <verse eid="MRK 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 8:19" />Minung 5,000 hrang ah sang hlawm nga ka seu lai ah khin an hlahmi a nepnawi kho khawzat nan sar? tih khi nan cing i lo maw?” tiah a sut hnei.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 8:19">Anni nih a sinah, “Kho hleinih,” tiah an let.<verse eid="MRK 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 8:20" />Cun Jesuh nih an sinah, “minung 4,000 hrang ah sang hlawm sarih ka seu lai ah khi an hlahmi a nepnawi kho khawzat nan sar?” tiah a sut hnei.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 8:20">Cule an ni nih a sinah, “Kho sarih,” tiah an let.<verse eid="MRK 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 8:21" />Cule Jesuh nih an sinah, “Cucu nan fiahthiam rih cuang lo maw?” tiah a ti hnei.<verse eid="MRK 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesuh nih Bethsaida ah Mitkhang Pa A Damter</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 8:22" />Cun Bethsaida khua an ban. Mitkhang pa pakhat cu a sinah an tianpit ih tham dingah Jesuh cu an hler. <verse eid="MRK 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 8:23" />Cun Jesuh nih mitkhang pa cu a kut in a tlai ih khaw lengah a ṭhi ta. Cule a mit ah cihrit a khak ih a tlunah a kut a suang. Cun Jesuh nih a sinah, “Zangtu tal hmu thiam cim?” tiah a sut.<verse eid="MRK 8:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 8:24" />Mitkhang pa cu tlun la a zoh ih, “Minung pawl ka hmu thei, asinain thingkuang feh deido mang an i,” tiah a ti.<verse eid="MRK 8:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 8:25" />Cun Jesuh nih a mit cu a tham sak sal ih a mit cu a hrak. A mit cu a damsal ih zang hmahhmah fiangten a hmu thei. <verse eid="MRK 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 8:26" />Cule Jesuh nih, “Khaw sungah lut vai hlah,” tiah thu a pe ih inn ah a tlung ter.<verse eid="MRK 8:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Peter nih Jesuh ih Thu Phuansuahnak</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:13-20">Matthai 16.13–20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:18-21">Luka 9.18–21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 8:27" />Cun Jesuh le a dungthluntu pawl cu Sisaria Filipi ih khawte pawl ah an feh. Jesuh nih lampi lakah a dungthluntu pawl cu, “Mi nih kei hi hutu tiah ka na ti?” tiah a sut hnei.<verse eid="MRK 8:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 8:28" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8.28 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MRK 6:14">Mar 6.14</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 6:15">15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:7">Luk 9.7</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 9:8">8</ref></char>
    </note>A dungthluntu pawl nih a sinah, “Baptisma petu Johan a si, ta ti. Asinain mi hrekkhat nih Elijah a si, ta ti. Mi hrekkhat nih profet pakhat khat a si, tiah ta ti eng,” tiah an ti.<verse eid="MRK 8:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 8:29" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8.29 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 6:68">Joh 6.68</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 6:69">69</ref></char>
    </note>Cule Jesuh nih an sinah, “Asihle nan teh kei hi hutu tiah ka na ti?” tiah a sut hnei.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 8:29">Peter nih a sinah, “Nang cu Khrih na si,” tiah a sawn.<verse eid="MRK 8:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 8:30" />Cule Jesuh nih a thuhla cu hutukhaw sim lo dingah khoh ngaiin ralrinnak a pe hnei.<verse eid="MRK 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesuh nih A Tuar ding le A Thih ding Thu A Sim</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:21-28">Matthai 16.21–28</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:22-27">Luka 9.22–27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 8:31" />Cun Jesuh nih a dungthluntu pawl thuzirh a thok. Minung fapa cu harnak tamngai a tuar thok ih upa pawl, puithiam upa pawl le daanthiam pawl nih an hnong thok. Cule an that thok ih ni thum hnukah a thosal thok, tiah a zirh hnei. <verse eid="MRK 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 8:32" />Cun cuvai thu cu an sinah langhngan ngaiin a sim hnei. Cule Peter nih Jesuh cu hmun dang deuhah a ṭhita ih a mawhthluk. <verse eid="MRK 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 8:33" />Asinain Jesuh cu a her fa ih a dungthluntu pawl zoh hnei pah in Peter cu a tai, “Seihtan, ka dung la ah feh! Zangahtihle Pathian thil ruat loʼn minung thil sawn na ruat,” tiah a ti.<verse eid="MRK 8:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 8:34" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8.34 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 10:38">Mat 10.38</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 14:27">Luk 14.27</ref></char>
    </note>Cun Jesuh nih mipi pawl le a dungthluntu pawl cu a ko hnei ih, an sinah, “Hutu khaw ka dung ka na thlun duhtu cu ama le ma hnong fa seh, cule a thinglamtah phur in ka dung ka thlun seh. <verse eid="MRK 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 8:35" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8.35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:39">Mat 10.39</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:33">Luk 17.33</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:25">Joh 12.25</ref></char></note>Zangahtihle hutu poh khaw ama ih nunnak a rung duhtu cu a nunnak a sung thok, asinain hutu poh khaw keimai hrang le thuthang ṭha ruangih a nunnak a hlotu cu a nunnak a run ngah thok. <verse eid="MRK 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 8:36" />Zangahtihle mi pakhat nih leilung pumpi hi co in ama ih nunnak hlo hnik sehla, a hrangah zangtu hlawknak a um? <verse eid="MRK 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 8:37" />A nunnak cu zangtu thawn in a lei thei sal thok? <verse eid="MRK 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 8:38" />Hutu khaw sualnak le rinumlonak ih a khatmi hivai san ah, kei le ka thu a zahpittu cu minung fapa nih a Pa ih sunlawinak le a thianghlim vancungmi pawl thawn an tian leh tikah a zahpit hnei ve thok,” tiah a ti.<verse eid="MRK 8:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="MRK 9" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 9:1" />Cun Jesuh nih an sinah, “Thutak in nan ta sim, hivai hmun ih a dingmi mi hrekkhat hi, Pathian ih Uknak cu huham thawn a tian an hmuh hlan lo, thihnak tep lo dingmi an um,” tiah a ti.<verse eid="MRK 9:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesuh ih Muihmel Thlenfaknak</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:1-13">Matthai 17.1–13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:28-36">Luka 9.28–36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 9:2" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9.2–7 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2PE 1:17">2 Pet 1.17</ref>,<ref loc="2PE 1:18">18</ref></char>
    </note>Cun ni ruk hnukah, Jesuh nih Peter, James le Johan pawl cu tlang tlunah anma lawng a kai pit hnei. Cule Jesuh cu an hmai ah a muihmel a thleng fa. <verse eid="MRK 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 9:3" />A hnipuan cu a tleu ih a var setak — leitlun ih thil sawptu hutu mang khaw nih cutluk var in an tuah thei thok lo. <verse eid="MRK 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 9:4" />Cun an sinah Elijah cu Moses thawn an rong lang ih Jesuh thawn an be fa berbo. <verse eid="MRK 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 9:5" />Cule Peter nih Jesuh sinah, “Rabbi, aiva ih kan um hi a ṭha tuk. Thlam pathum in sa u sing, na hrangah pakhat, Moses hrangah pakhat, cule Elijah hrangah pakhat,” tiah a ti. <verse eid="MRK 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 9:6" />Zangruangah tihle an ṭih tuk ih ṭon ding dang a fiah lo ruangah a si.<verse eid="MRK 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 9:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9.7 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 3:17">Mat 3.17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:11">Mar 1.11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:22">Luk 3.22</ref></char>
    </note>Cun khawdur nih a ron khuh hnei ih khawdur sung in aw pakhat nih, “Hihi ka duhdawt ngaimi ka Fapa a si — a thu ngai uh!” tiah a ti. <verse eid="MRK 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 9:8" />Cucangin dungthlutu pathum pawl cu an kiangkap an zoh lohli ih hutukhaw an hmu lo; Jesuh kau an hram ih a um cu an hmu.<verse eid="MRK 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 9:9" />Tlang tlun in an rong ṭum laiah, “Minung Fapa thihnak ihsin a thawhsal hlan lo cu, an hmuh mi thilpawl hutukhaw sim lo dingah,” Jesuh nih thu a pe hnei.<verse eid="MRK 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 9:10" />Cuvai a thupekmi cu an thlun ih, “ ‘thihnak in thawhsal,’ tihmi cu zangtu khi i la na?” tiah pakhat le pakhat an sut fa. <verse eid="MRK 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 9:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 11:14">Mat 11.14</ref></char></note>Cule Jesuh sinah, “Zangruangah daanthiam pawl nih Elijah a tiang hmasak thok an ti?” tiah an sut.<verse eid="MRK 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 9:12" />Cun Jesuh nih an sinah, “Elijah cu a tiang hmasa taktak thok ih zang hmahhmah a remṭhasal colh thok. Zangruangah Ca Thianghlim sungah, Minung Fapa cu harnak tamngai a tuar thok ih hnon a i thok, tiah ngan a i? <verse eid="MRK 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 9:13" />Thutakin nan ta sim, Elijah cu a tiang taktak cem, cule a thuhla an ngancia mangin, an duhduh in a tlunah an tuah,” tiah a ti.<verse eid="MRK 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesuh nih Thlarau Sia ih Molhmi Nappang A Damter</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:14-20">Matthai 17.14–20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:37-43a">Luka 9.37–43a</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 9:14" />Cun dungthluntu dang pawl sin an tian tikah, mipi tamngai nih an kulh ih daanthiam pawl le dungthluntu pawl thu an el fak ngelngo cu an hmu. <verse eid="MRK 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 9:15" />Cule mipi zate cu Jesuh an hmuh cangka in an mang a bang setak, cule ama hmuak dingin a sinah an zuang. <verse eid="MRK 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 9:16" />Cun Jesuh nih a dungthluntu pawl sinah, “An ni thawn zangtu nan el fa?” tiah a sut hnei.<verse eid="MRK 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 9:17" />Cule mipi lakin mi pakhat nih a sawn ih, “Sayapa, nan sinah ka fapa ka tian pit, zangahtihle thlarau sia nih ṭon thiam lo in a tuah. <verse eid="MRK 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 9:18" />Thlarau sia nih a molh cangcang in leilung ah a hlon fa, a ka in rabuan a suak, a ha a rial ih a ṭhong colh. Cule na dungthluntu pawl sinah, thlarau sia dawisuak dingin ka sim hnei naʼn, an dawisuak thei lo,” tiah a ti.<verse eid="MRK 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 9:19" />Cule Jesuh nih a sawn ih an sinah, “Aw zupnak nei lo a tun san minung pawl, nan sinah khawtik tiang ka um rih thok? Nan tlunah khawtik tiang ka thinsau thok? Cuvai pa cu ka sinah tianpit uh,” tiah a ti. <verse eid="MRK 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 9:20" />Cule cuvai pa cu Jesuh sinah an feh pit.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 9:20">Thlarau sia nih Jesuh a hmuh cangka in nappang pa cu a caih ter ih leilung ah a ngal, a tawng fa ih a ka in rabuan a suak. <verse eid="MRK 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 9:21" />Cule Jesuh nih, “Hitin a sihnak hi rei cem im?” tiah a pa cu a sut.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 9:21">Cule a pa nih, “A nappan lai in a si cem. <verse eid="MRK 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 9:22" />Vei tamngai cu thlarau sia nih that dingin meisa sung le ti sungah a hlon. Na tuah theimi a sih ahcun kan thinfah la kan bawm hram,” tiah a ti.<verse eid="MRK 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 9:23" />Jesuh nih a sinah, “Na tuah theimi a sih ahcun, tiah na ti. A zumtu hrang ahcun zang hmahhmah hi a cang thei colh,” tiah a ti.<verse eid="MRK 9:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 9:24" />Hmakhatte ah nappang pa ih pa cu a hek ih, “Ka zum, ka zuplonak ka bawm hram,” tiah a ti.<verse eid="MRK 9:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 9:25" />Jesuh nih mipi pawl hmuakkhawm fa cu a hmuh hnei tikah, thlarau sia cu a tai ih, a sinah, “Naset le ṭon thiam lo nang thlarau sia, hivai nappang pa sungin suak la lut sal i hlah, tiah thu ta pe,” tiah a ti.<verse eid="MRK 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 9:26" />Cule thlarau sia cu a hek ih nappang pa cu a caih ter hnukah a sungin a suak. Nappang pa cu mithi mangin a um ih, mi tamngai nih, “Nappang pa a thi,” tiah an ti. <verse eid="MRK 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 9:27" />Asinain Jesuh nih a kut in nappang pa cu a la ih a han tho, cule a hang ding.<verse eid="MRK 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 9:28" />Cule Jesuh cu inn songah a lut ih a dungthluntu pawl nih a thupteʼn, “Zangah kan hmah kan dawisuak thei lo?” tiah an sut.<verse eid="MRK 9:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 9:29" />Cule Jesuh nih an sinah, “Thlacamnak lo cun, himang thlarau sia cu zangkhaw nih a dawisuak thei lo,” tiah a ti hnei.<verse eid="MRK 9:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesuh nih A Thihnak ding Thu A Sim Sal</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:22-23">Matthai 17.22–23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:43b-45">Luka 9.43b–45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 9:30" />Cun Jesuh le a dungthluntu pawl cu cuvai hmun ihsin an pok ih Galilee peng palpah in an feh. Cule Jesuh nih hutukhaw ih an fiah ding a duh lo. <verse eid="MRK 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 9:31" />Zangahtihle a dungthluntu pawl thu a zirh hnei ih, an sinah, “Minung Fapa cu mi kut ah pek a i thok ih an that thok. Cule an thah hnuk ni thum hnukah a thosal thok,” tiah a ti hnei.<verse eid="MRK 9:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 9:32" />Asinain zangtu a sim tih an cing thiam lo, a suh le an ṭih ih an sut ngam lo.<verse eid="MRK 9:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hutu A Hnem Bik?</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:1-5">Matthai 18.1–5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:46-48">Luka 9.46–48</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 9:33" />Cun Jesuh le a dungthluntu pawl cu Kapernaum khua an ban. Cule inn songih a um laiah, Jesuh nih an sinah, “Lampi lakah zangtu thu nan el fa ngelngo?” tiah a sut hnei.<verse eid="MRK 9:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 9:34" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9.34 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 22:24">Luk 22.24</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Asinain daiten an um colh, zangahtihle lampi lakih an el fakmi cu an lakah hutu a hnem bik tihmi a i. <verse eid="MRK 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 9:35" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 20:26">Mat 20.26</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 20:27">27</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 23:11">23.11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:43">Mar 10.43</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 10:44">44</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:26">Luk 22.26</ref></char></note>Cun Jesuh cu a to, cule a dungthluntu hleinih cu a ko hnei ih, an sinah, “Hutukhaw hmasabik sih a duhtu cu mi hmahhmah lakah netabik a i thok ih, mi hmahhmah ih siahhlawh a i thok,” tiah a ti hnei. <verse eid="MRK 9:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 9:36" />Jesuh nih nappang pa a ko ih an laifang ah a ding ter, cule a kut in a cawi ih, an sinah, <verse eid="MRK 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 9:37" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.37 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:40">Mat 10.40</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:16">Luk 10.16</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:20">Joh 13.20</ref></char></note>“Hutukhaw ka hmin in himang nappang pakhat a cohlangtu cu kei ka na cohlang a i. Cule hutukhaw ka na cohlangtu cu kei kau ka na cohlang i lo in, ka na thlahtu sawn a cohlang mi a i,” tiah a ti.<verse eid="MRK 9:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kan Na Dokalh Lotu Cu Kan La Ṭang An I</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 9:49">Luka 9.49</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 9:50">50</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 9:38" />Johan nih Jesuh sinah, “Sayapa, na hmin in thlarau sia a dawisuaktu mi pakhat kan hmu ih kan na thluntu a ih lo ruangah cuvai pa cu kan dawn,” tiah a ti.<verse eid="MRK 9:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 9:39" />Asinain Jesuh nih, “Dawn hlah uh, zangahtihle ka hmin ih mangbangza a tuahtu cu nih ka na relsiat thok lo. <verse eid="MRK 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 9:40" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.40 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 12:30">Mat 12.30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:23">Luk 11.23</ref></char></note>Zangahtihle kan na dokalh lotu cu kan la ṭang a i. <verse eid="MRK 9:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 9:41" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.41 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:42">Mat 10.42</ref></char></note>Zangahtihle thutak in nan ta sim, Khrih ih ta na ih ruangah ka hmin in din ding ti khuat khat ta petu cu, a tuah ṭhatman a sung hrimhrim thok lo.<verse eid="MRK 9:41" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sual dingih Tukforhnak</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:6-9">Matthai 18.6–9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:1">Luka 17.1</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 17:2">2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 9:42" />“Cun hutukhaw ka na zumtu hivai nappang pakhat khat a sual tertu cu a hngawng ah fang rialnak lungtum thlaih pit in tipi thuanthum sungah hlon fa sehla a hrangah a ṭha sawn. <verse eid="MRK 9:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 9:43" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.43 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 5:30">Mat 5.30</ref></char></note>Na kut nih ta sual ter asihle na kut cu ṭhot. Taksa kim lo in nunnak sungih luh cu kut panih thawn a mit kel lo mi meisa, hell sungih feh nakin na hrangah a ṭha sawn. <verse eid="MRK 9:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" pubnumber="[44]" sid="MRK 9:44" /><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9.44 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">A hrekkhat kutngan cabu pawl sungah cu afate 44: </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Cuvai hmun ah cun zang pawl cu an thi kel lo ih meisa khaw a mit kel lo; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">tiah an be (afate 48 zoh).</char></note> <verse eid="MRK 9:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 9:45" />Cun na ke nih ta sual ter asihle na ke cu ṭhot. Ke kim lo in nunnak sung luh cu ke panih thawn hell sungih luh nakin na hrangah a ṭha sawn. <verse eid="MRK 9:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" pubnumber="[46]" sid="MRK 9:46" /><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9.46 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">A hrekkhat kutngan cabu pawl sungah cu afate 46: </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Cuvai hmun ahcun zang pawl cu an thi kel lo ih meisa khaw a mit kel lo; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">tiah an be (afate 48 zoh).</char></note> <verse eid="MRK 9:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 9:47" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.47 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 5:29">Mat 5.29</ref></char></note>Cun na mit nih ta sual ter asihle na mit cu khorh. Mit pakhat thawn Pathian Uknak sungih luh cu mit panih thawn hell ih luh nakin na hrangah a ṭha sawn. <verse eid="MRK 9:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 9:48" />Cuvai hmun ahcun ‘zang pawl cu an thi kel lo ih meisa khaw a mit kel lo.’<verse eid="MRK 9:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 9:49" />“Thawinak cu ci in thianfaiter a sih mangin mi hmahhmah cu meisa in thianfaiter colh an i ve thok.<verse eid="MRK 9:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 9:50" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9.50 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 5:13">Mat 5.13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 14:34">Luk 14.34</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 14:35">35</ref></char>
    </note>“Ci cu a ṭha, asinain a al nak a net asihle, zangtin na al ter sal thok?</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 9:50">“Nanma ah ci cu nei uh, cule pakhat le pakhat rem fa uh,” tiah a ti.<verse eid="MRK 9:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="MRK 10" />
  <para style="s">Jesuh nih Nupa Mak Faknak Thu A Zirh</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:1-12">Matthai 19.1–12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 16:18">Luka 16.18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 10:1" />Cun Jesuh cu cuvai hmun in a suak ih Jordan tikua ralkhat le Judea peng laah a feh. Mipi pawl cu a sinah an hmuakkhawm fa sei ih a tuah kel mangin thu a zirh hnei.<verse eid="MRK 10:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 10:2" />Cun Farasi pawl cu a sinah an feh ih, hneksak an duh ruangah, “Pami nih a nupi ma sehla daan nih a siang maw?” tiah thu an sut.<verse eid="MRK 10:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 10:3" />Jesuh nih a let hnei ih, “Moses nih zangtu thu nan ta pe?” tiah a sut hnei.<verse eid="MRK 10:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 10:4" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10.4 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 5:31">Mat 5.31</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Cule an ni nih, “Moses nih maknak ca ngan pit in mak cu a siang,” tiah an ti.<verse eid="MRK 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 10:5" />Asinain Jesuh nih an sinah, “Nan lungruh tuk ruangah nan hrangah hi daan hi Moses nih a ngan. <verse eid="MRK 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 10:6" />Asinain sersiam thoktir ihsin ‘Pathian nih numi le pami a tuah.’ <verse eid="MRK 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 10:7" />‘Curuangah pami nih a nu le pa ramta pit in a nupi a kop thok.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10.7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">A hrekkhat kutngan cabu pawl sungah cu </char><char style="fq" closed="false">a nupi a kop thok; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">a tel lo.</char></note> <verse eid="MRK 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 10:8" />Cule taksa panih cu taksa pakhat ah an cang thok.’ Curuangah an ni cu panih an i, i lo, taksa pakhat an i sawn. <verse eid="MRK 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 10:9" />Curuangah Pathian ih a kop cem mi cu hutukhaw nih ṭhen hlah seu,” tiah a ti.<verse eid="MRK 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 10:10" />Cun inn song an luh sal tikah, a dungthluntu pawl nih cuvai thu cu an sut sal. <verse eid="MRK 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 10:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.11–12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 5:32">Mat 5.32</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 7:10">1 Kor 7.10</ref>,<ref loc="1CO 7:11">11</ref></char></note>Cule Jesuh nih an sinah, “Hutukhaw a nupi ama ih nupi dang a ṭhit asihle ṭangṭawm sualnak a tuah. <verse eid="MRK 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 10:12" />Cun numi khaw nih a pasal ama ih pasal dang a neih asihle ṭangṭawm sualnak a tuah,” tiah a ti.<verse eid="MRK 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesuh nih Nappang pawl Thlawsuah A Pe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:13-15">Matthai 19.13–15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:15-17">Luka 18.15–17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 10:13" />Cun mipi pawl nih, Jesuh ih tham dingah, nappang pawl cu a sinah an ṭhi. Cule a dungthluntu pawl nih cu pawl cu an tai. <verse eid="MRK 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 10:14" />Asinain Jesuh nih a hmuh tikah, a thin a se ih an sinah, “Nappang pawl cu ka sinah tiang seu, dawn hlah uh. Zangahtihle Pathian Uknak cu himang nappang pawl ih ta a i. <verse eid="MRK 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 10:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 18:3">Mat 18.3</ref></char></note>Thutak in nan ta sim, ‘Hutu khaw sisehla nappang pawl mangin Pathian Uknak a cohlang lo tu cu Pathian Uknak sungah an lut thei kel thok lo,’ ” tiah a ti. <verse eid="MRK 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 10:16" />Cule nappang pawl cu a ban tlunah a cawi hnei, an tlunah a kut a suang ih thlawsuah a pe hnei.<verse eid="MRK 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Milian Pa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:16-30">Matthai 19.16–30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:18-30">Luka 18.18–30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 10:17" />Cun Jesuh cu khual tlawn ding ih a suah zawngah, a sinah mi pakhat a zuang ih a khuk bil in, “Zirhtu ṭha, kumkhua nunnak ka co theinak dingah zangtu ka tuah thok?” tiah a sut.<verse eid="MRK 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 10:18" />Cule Jesuh nih a sinah, “Zangruangah zirhtu ṭha tiah ka na ko? Pathian hrello mi ṭha hukhaw an um lo. <verse eid="MRK 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 10:19" />Thupek pawl khi fiah kau hmah ci ee: ‘Mi that hlah, ṭangṭawm sualnak tuah hlah, lolak hlah, fiahpitnak dik lo rel hlah, mi deu hlah, na nu le pa cu upat hnei,’ ” tiah a ti.<verse eid="MRK 10:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 10:20" />Cun ani nih Jesuh sinah, “Sayapa, cuvai pawl hmahhmah cu ka no lai ihsin ka thlun hnei colh cia mi an i,” tiah a ti.<verse eid="MRK 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 10:21" />Cun Jesuh nih cuvai pa cu a zoh ih, a duhdawt, cule a sinah, “Thil pakhat na sam rih: feh la, na neihmi hmahhmah zuar pit in mi fahrah pawl pe hnei, cule vancung ah hlawnthil na nei thok. Cun ka dung ka thlun,” tiah a ti. <verse eid="MRK 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 10:22" />Cun cuvai pa cu Jesuh sipmi thu ah a riah a se ih thin nuam lo ngai in a feh, zangahtihle ani cu thilri tamngai a neih ruangah a i.<verse eid="MRK 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 10:23" />Cun Jesuh cu a kiangkap a zoh ih a dungthluntu pawl sinah, “Paisa nei milian pawl hrangah Pathian Uknak sungih luh cu zangtlukin a har!” tiah a ti.<verse eid="MRK 10:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 10:24" />Cule a dungthluntu pawl cu a sipmi thu ah an mang a bang. Asinain Jesuh nih an sinah, “Fale pawl, Pathian Uknak sungih luh cu zangtlukin a har! <verse eid="MRK 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 10:25" />Pathian Uknak sungih milian pa a luh ding nakin ṭhim awng sungih kalauk luh ding hman a bai sawn,” tiah a sim hnei sal.<verse eid="MRK 10:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 10:26" />Cun dungthluntu pawl cu an mang a bang hlehhlo ih, a sinah, “Asihle hutu rundam a i thei thok?” tiah an ti.<verse eid="MRK 10:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 10:27" />Cule Jesuh nih a zoh hnei ih, an sinah, “Minung hrang ahcun thil cangthei lo a i, asinain Pathian hrang ahcun thil cangthei lo a i lo. Zangahtihle Pathian thawn cu zang hmahhmah hi a cangthei colh,” tiah a ti hnei.<verse eid="MRK 10:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 10:28" />Cutikah Peter nih a sinah, “Ngai hnik, zang hmahhmah ramta pit in na dung kan thlun,” tiah a ti.<verse eid="MRK 10:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 10:29" />Cule Jesuh nih, “Thutak in nan ta sim, hutukhaw siseh la keimai ruang ah le thuthang ṭha ruang ah, a inn, a u le nau, a nu le pa, a fale, a leiram pawl a ramta tu cu, <verse eid="MRK 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 10:30" />tun san sung ah tam sinsin a ngah thok. A inn, a u le nau, a nu, a fale leh a leiram pawl khaw a let zakhat in a ngah thok — hremnak pawl khaw a ngah thok. Cule a tiang lai dingmi san ah kumkhua nunnak a ngah thok. <verse eid="MRK 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 10:31" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 20:16">Mat 20.16</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 13:30">Luk 13.30</ref></char></note>Asinain hmasabik a i mi, mi tamngai cu netabik an i leh thok ih, netabik pawl cu hmasabik an i leh thok,” tiah a ti.<verse eid="MRK 10:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesuh nih A Thihnak ding Thu Vei Thumnak A Sim</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:17-19">Matthai 20.17–19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:31-34">Luka 18.31–34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 10:32" />Cun Jerusalem la ih an feh lai ah Jesuh cu an hmai ah a feh khan, a dungthluntu pawl cu an mang a bang ih a thluntu midang pawl khaw an ṭih. Cule dungthluntu hleinih pawl cu hmun dang deuh ah a ṭhi ta hnei sal ih a tlunih thilcang dingmi pawl a sim hnei. <verse eid="MRK 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 10:33" />Jesuh nih, “Ngai hnik uh! Jerusalem khua kan ban thok ih, Minung Fapa cu puithiam upa pawl le daanthiam pawl kut ah pek a i thok. Cule an ni nih thi dingin mawh an puh thok, cule Zentail pawl sinah an ap thok. <verse eid="MRK 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 10:34" />Cun hnihsuahsainak ah an hmang thok ih cihrit an khak thok, an thawi thok ih an that thok. Cule ni thum hnukah a thosal thok,” tiah a ti hnei.<verse eid="MRK 10:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">James le Johan ih Dilnak</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:20-28">Matthai 20.20–28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 10:35" />Cun Zebedi ih fapa James le Johan cu Jesuh sinah an feh ih, “Sayapa, thil ta hlermi hmahhmah kan tuahsak la kan duh,” tiah an ti.<verse eid="MRK 10:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 10:36" />Cule Jesuh nih an sinah, “Zangtu tuahsak nan duh?” tiah a sut hnei.<verse eid="MRK 10:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 10:37" />Cule an ni nih a sinah, “Na sunlawinak ah na vorh la ah pakhat, na keh la ah pakhat, kan toter veve hram,” tiah an ti.<verse eid="MRK 10:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 10:38" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10.38 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 12:50">Luk 12.50</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Asinain Jesuh nih an sinah, “Zangtu nan hler tihmi nan fiah lo. Ka din dingmi khuat hi nan ding thei thok maw? Asihlole ka co dingmi baptisma teh nan co thei thok maw?” tiah a ti hnei.<verse eid="MRK 10:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 10:39" />Cun an ni nih a sinah, “Kan tuah thei thok,” tiah an ti.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 10:39">Cule Jesuh nih an sinah, “Ka din dingmi khuat cu nan ding thei kau thok, cule ka co dingmi baptisma khaw nan co thei kau thok. <verse eid="MRK 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 10:40" />Asinain ka vorh la le ka keh la ih to ding thu cu kei ih pek dingmi a i lo; timtuah sak ciami pawl hrang sawn ah a i,” tiah a ti.<verse eid="MRK 10:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 10:41" />Cun cuvai thu cu a dang pahra pawl nih an theih tikah James le Johan cungah an lung a awi lo. <verse eid="MRK 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 10:42" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.42–43 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 22:25">Luk 22.25</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 22:26">26</ref></char></note>Cule Jesuh nih a sinah a ko hnei ih, an sinah, “Zentail pawl uktu dingih ruahmi pawl cu an mipi tlunah an bawisak fa ngai ih, an hotu pawl khaw an tlunah thu an nei ngai, tih cu nan fiah. <verse eid="MRK 10:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 10:43" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.43,44 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 23:11">Mat 23.11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:35">Mar 9.35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:26">Luk 22.26</ref></char></note>Asinain nan lakah cu hi mangin i ding a i lo. Hutu khaw nan lak ih hnem bik sih a duh ahcun nan siahhlawh i sawn seh. <verse eid="MRK 10:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 10:44" />Cule hutukhaw nan lak ih hmasabik sih a duh ahcun nan zate ih sal i sawn seh. <verse eid="MRK 10:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 10:45" />Zangahtihle Minung Fapa hman riatmi i dingah a tiang lo, riantu i dingah le mi tamngai tlatnak hrangah a nunnak pe ding sawn ah a tiang,” tiah a ti.<verse eid="MRK 10:45" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesuh nih Mitkhang Bartimias A Damter</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:29-34">Matthai 20.29–34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:35-43">Luka 18.35–43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 10:46" />Cun Jesuh le a dungthluntu pawl cu Jerikho khua an ban; cule a dungthluntu pawl le mipi tamngai thawn Jerikho in an pawh zawngah, Timias ih fapa Bartimias, mitkhang kutdawh, cu lampi kap ah a to. <verse eid="MRK 10:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 10:47" />Cule Nazareth mi Jesuh a si tih a theih tikah, a hek ih, “Jesuh, David Fapa, ka cungah thinfahnak nei hram!” tiah a ti.<verse eid="MRK 10:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 10:48" />Cule mi tamngai nih an tai ih, daiten um an forh. Asinain a hek hlehhlo ih, “David Fapa, ka cungah thinfahnak nei hram,” tiah a ti.<verse eid="MRK 10:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 10:49" />Cun Jesuh cu a cawlhnga ih, “Ko uh,” tiah a ti.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 10:49">Cule mitkhang pa cu an ko ih, a sinah, “Thin thlangamten um, hang tho, Jesuh nih ta ko,” tiah an ti.<verse eid="MRK 10:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 10:50" />Cule a hnipuan cu a hlon ta ih, Jesuh sinah cun a pet vervo.<verse eid="MRK 10:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 10:51" />Cule Jesuh nih a let ih, a sinah, “Na hrangah zangtu ta tuahsak na duh?” tiah a sut.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 10:51">Cule mitkhang pa nih a sinah, “Rabbi, khua hmu thei sal ningla ka duh,” tiah a ti.<verse eid="MRK 10:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 10:52" />Cule Jesuh nih a sinah, “Feh, na zupnak nih ta damter cem,” tiah a ti.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 10:52">Cule hmakhatte ah khua a hmu thei sal ih Jesuh cu zalam ah a thlun.<verse eid="MRK 10:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="MRK 11" />
  <para style="s">Jerusalem ah Nehnak thawn Luhnak</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:1-11">Matthai 21.1–11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:28-40">Luka 19.28–40</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:12-19">Johan 12.12–19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 11:1" />Cun Jerusalem la an naih i mepmo ih, Olif Tlang ih Bethfath le Bethani khua hram an bat tikah, Jesuh nih a dungthluntu panih cu a thlah hnei ih, <verse eid="MRK 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 11:2" />an sinah, “Nan hmala ih khaw sungah feh uh, khaw sungih nan luh cangka in hutukhaw ih an to kel lomi lak note hri thawn an khihmi nan hmu thok. A hri cu phoih uhla duk ta uh. <verse eid="MRK 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 11:3" />Cule mi pakhat khat nih, ‘Zangah aitin nan tuah?’ tiah nan ta tih eng le, ‘Bawipa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11.3 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Bawipa; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">lole </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">a neitu.</char></note> nih a ṭul, hi hmunah nan ta kuat sal lohli thok,’ ti uh,” tiah a ti.<verse eid="MRK 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 11:4" />Cun an feh ih lampi lengih kotka ah lak note an khih cu an hmu, cule a hri cu an phoih. <verse eid="MRK 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 11:5" />Cun cuvai hmun ih a dingmi mi hrekkhat nih, “Zangah lak note cu a hri nan phoih?” tiah an sut.<verse eid="MRK 11:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 11:6" />Cule an ni nih Jesuh ih a sip hnei cia mangin an sim, cun an feh ter. <verse eid="MRK 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 11:7" />Cule Jesuh sinah lak note cu an ṭhi ta ih a cungah puan an thah sak ih Jesuh cu a cungah a to. <verse eid="MRK 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 11:8" />Cun minung tamngai nih zalam tluanah an puan an thap ih mi hrekkhat nih lo sungih sawlhnah an sat ih zalam tluanah an thap. <verse eid="MRK 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 11:9" />Cun a hmaiih a fehtu pawl le a dungih a thluntu pawl cu an hek ih, “Hosanna! Bawipa ih hmin in a tiangtu cu thlawsuah in um seh! <verse eid="MRK 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 11:10" />A tiang dingmi kan pa David ih uknak cu thlawsuah in um seh! A sangbik ah Hosanna!” tiah an ti.<verse eid="MRK 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 11:11" />Cule Jesuh cu Jerusalem ah a feh ih biakinn songah a lut. Thil hmahhmah a zoh colh hnukah, ni a sim i ih, dungthluntu hleinih pawl thawn Bethani khua ah an feh.<verse eid="MRK 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesuh nih Thei Kuang A Camsiat</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:18-19">Matthai 21.18–19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 11:12" />Cun a zingthlala ah, Bethani khua in an kirhsal tikah, Jesuh cu a caw a ṭam. <verse eid="MRK 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 11:13" />Cule lamhla nawnah a hnah a nim ngaimi thei kuang pakhat a hmu ih a thei ka hmuh pangah tiah thei kuang la cu a feh. Thei kuang umnak a bat tikah, a hnah hrello zangkhaw a hmu lo; zangahtihle thei a thei can a i lo. <verse eid="MRK 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 11:14" />Cutikah Jesuh nih thei kuang cu, “A kumkhua in hutukhaw nih na thei ei i nawn hlah seu,” tiah a ti.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 11:14">Cule a dungthluntu pawl nih a ṭonmi cu an thei.<verse eid="MRK 11:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesuh Biakinn ah A Feh</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:12-17">Matthai 21.12–17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:45-48">Luka 19.45–48</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 2:13-22">Johan 2.13–22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 11:15" />Cun Jerusalem an ban. Cule Jesuh cu Biakinn kulh sungah a lut ih cuva ih thil zuartu pawl le thil leitu pawl dawisuah a thok. Cule Paisa thlengtu pawl ih cabuai le thute zuartu pawl ih tokheng pawl khaw a linglet colh. <verse eid="MRK 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 11:16" />Cule hutukhaw Biakinn songah zangtumang thilri khaw phur in vah a sian hnei lo. <verse eid="MRK 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 11:17" />Cun thu a zirh hnei ih an sinah, “Ca Thianghlim sungah ‘Ka inn cu miphun zate hrangah thlacamnak inn tiah kawh a i thok,’ tiah ngan a i lo mawh? Asinain damiah pawl ih rolhnak lungkuak ah nan tuah,” tiah a ti hnei.<verse eid="MRK 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 11:18" />Puithiam upa pawl le daanthiam pawl nih cuvai cu an theih tikah, Jesuh cu an ṭih ruangah a thah thei dan ding an hrawl. Zangahtihle mipi zate cu Jesuh ih thuzirhmi ah an mang a bang.<verse eid="MRK 11:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 11:19" />Cun ni a sim i tikah Jesuh le a dungthluntu pawl cu khaw sung in an suak.<verse eid="MRK 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Thei Kuang sin in Zirnak</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:20-22">Matthai 21.20–22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 11:20" />Cun a zingthlala zalam ih an feh laiah, a tawhram in a rocar mi thei kuang cu an hmu. <verse eid="MRK 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 11:21" />Cun Peter cu a cing sal ih Jesuh sinah, “Rabbi, Zohhnik aw! Na camsiatmi thei kuang cu a rocar colh,” tiah a ti.<verse eid="MRK 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 11:22" />Cule Jesuh nih a let ih an sinah, “Pathian zum uh. <verse eid="MRK 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 11:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 17:20">Mat 17.20</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 13:2">1 Kor 13.2</ref></char></note>Thutak in nan ta sim, hutukhaw a thinlung sungah rinhelhnak nei lo in a sipmi mangin a cang tengteng thok tiah a zup ahcun, hivai tlang hi, thawnfa pit in tipi thuanthum sungah ṭil, tiah a titu cu a ṭon mangin tuahsak a i thok. <verse eid="MRK 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 11:24" />Curuangah nan ta sim, thlacamnak thawn nan hlerhmi hmahhmah hi kan ngah cem tiah zum uh la, cule nan ta a si thok. <verse eid="MRK 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 11:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.25,26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 6:14">Mat 6.14</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 6:15">15</ref></char></note>Cun thla cam dingih nan din tikah, Van ih a um mi nan Pa nih nan sualnak pawl nan ta ngaihthiam theinak dingah, mi pakhat khat cungah lungkim lonak nan neih asihle ngaihthiam uh,” tiah a ti hnei. <verse eid="MRK 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" pubnumber="[26]" sid="MRK 11:26" /><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11.26 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">A hrekkhat kutngan cabu pawl sungah cu afate 26: </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Midang sualnak nan ngaihthiam lo ahcun vancung ih a um mi nan Pa nih nan sualnak nan ta ngaihthiam ve thok lo; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">tiah betmi a um (<char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 6:15">Mat 6.15</ref></char> zoh).</char></note><verse eid="MRK 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesuh ih Thuneihnak Thu Thusuhnak</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:23-27">Matthai 21.23–27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:1-8">Luka 20.1–8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 11:27" />Cun Jesuh le a dungthluntu pawl cu Jerusalem ah an ban sal. Cule Jesuh cu biakinn songih a feh laiah, puithiam upa pawl, daanthiam pawl le upa pawl nih an pha ih, <verse eid="MRK 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 11:28" />Jesuh sinah, “Himang thil pawl hi hutu ih thuneihnak in na tuah hnei? Asihlole himang thil pawl tuah dingah hutu nih thuneihnak ta pe?” tiah an sut.<verse eid="MRK 11:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 11:29" />Cule Jesuh nih an sinah, “Kei khaw thu pakhat nan ta sut ve thok ih, ka let uh. Cun zangtu thuneihnak thawn himang thil pawl ka tuah, tihmi nan ta sim thok. <verse eid="MRK 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 11:30" />Johan ih Baptisma hi vancung la in maw minung sin in a i? Ka let hnik uh,” tiah a ti hnei.<verse eid="MRK 11:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 11:31" />Cun cuvai thu cu anma ten an relkhawm ih, “Van la in a i, tiah kan tih le, ‘Zangruangah Johan cu nan zum lo,’ tiah kan na ti thok. <verse eid="MRK 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 11:32" />Cun ‘Minung sin in…,’ tiah kan ti thok maw?” (Zangahtihle mi hmahhmah nih Johan cu profet taktak a i tiah an pom ruangah mipi pawl an ṭih.) <verse eid="MRK 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 11:33" />Curuangah Jesuh sinah “Kan fiah ve lo,” tiah an let.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 11:33">Cule Jesuh nih an sinah, “Kei khaw zangtu thuneihnak thawn hi thil pawl ka tuah, tihmi nan ta sim ve thok lo,” tiah a ti hnei.<verse eid="MRK 11:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="MRK 12" />
  <para style="s">Sabit Dum Ṭuanṭuantu pawl thawn Tahṭhipnak</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:33-46">Matthai 21.33–46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:9-19">Luka 20.9–19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 12:1" />Cun Jesuh nih an sinah tahṭhipnak thawn thusip a thok. “Mi pakhat nih sabit dum a tuah ih hruang in a kulh, cule sabit ti surnak ah khur a lai ih hrawlte a don. Cun a dum cu man pek ih a sawngtu pawl sinah a ramta ih lam hlapi ah khual a tlawn. <verse eid="MRK 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 12:2" />A tikcu can a kim tikah, dum sawngtu pawl sin in a covo sabit thei la dingah, a siahhlawh pakhat a thlah. <verse eid="MRK 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 12:3" />Cun cuvaipa cu an tlai ih an thawi hnukah zahawr in an tlungter. <verse eid="MRK 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 12:4" />Cule an sinah siahhlawh dang pakhat cu a thlah seisei. Cun cuvaipa cu a lu ah an thawi ih hmualpho le ningzak in an tuah. <verse eid="MRK 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 12:5" />A dang a thlah sal seisei ih a thlahmi pa cu an that. Cule a dang tamngai khaw cu a thlah bet, a hrekkhat cu an thawi ih a hrekkhat cu an that. <verse eid="MRK 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 12:6" />Thlah dingmi pakhat la cu a nei rih, a duhdawt ngaimi a fapa a si. Netabikah dum sawngtu pawl sinah cun a fapa cu a thlah ih, ‘Ka fapa cu an upat kau thok,’ tiah a ti. <verse eid="MRK 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 12:7" />Asinain dum sawngtu pawl nih, ‘Hivaipa hi ro cotu thok cu a i. Cei uh, that lausing, cule a co dingmi ro hmahhmah cu kan maiʼ ta an i thok,’ tiah pakhat le pakhat an ti fa. <verse eid="MRK 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 12:8" />Cun cuvaipa cu an tlai ih an that, cule sabit dum lengah an hlon.<verse eid="MRK 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 12:9" />“Sabit dum neitu nih zangtin tuah lai? a feh thok ih dum sawngtu pawl cu a siatsuah hnei thok, cule sabit dum cu midang sinah a pe thok. <verse eid="MRK 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 12:10" />Ca thianghlim sungah:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:10">“ ‘Inn satu pawl ih an hnon mi lung cu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 12:10">A thupi bikmi innkil lung ah a cang.<verse eid="MRK 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 12:11" />Hihi Bawipa ih tuahmi a i,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 12:11">Cule kan mithmuh ah mangbangza a i, tiih nganmi khi nan siar kel lo maw?’ tiah a ti.”<verse eid="MRK 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 12:12" />Cun Judah upa pawl cu Jesuh tlaih dan ding an hrawl, asinain mipi pawl an ṭih. Zangahtihle cuvai tahṭhipnak cu anma tihsat ih a sipmi a si tih an fiah. Curuangah Jesuh cu an ramta ih lam hlapi ah an feh.<verse eid="MRK 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Siah Peknak Thu Thusuhnak</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:15-22">Matthai 22.15–22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:20-26">Luka 20.20–26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 12:13" />Cun a ṭonkam in ama an tlaih theinak dingah, Farasi hrekkhat le Herod ih milai hrekkhat cu Jesuh sinah an thlah. <verse eid="MRK 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 12:14" />Cun Jesuh sin an ban ih a sinah, “Sayapa, nang cu, mi nih zangtin ka na ruat eng thok, tih khaw zanghrel loʼn thudik na sim, tih kan fiah. Zangahtihle minung mithmai na zoh lo ih Pathian ih zalam cu dik ngaiin na zirh. Caesar sinih siah pek hi daan nih a siang maw siang lo? Kan pe thok maw pe thok lo?” tiah an sut.<verse eid="MRK 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 12:15" />Asinain Jesuh nih an depdetnak a fiah ih an sinah, “Zangruangah ka na hneksak eng? ngun tangka ka pe hnik uh, cule ka zoh hnik thok,” tiah a ti hnei.<verse eid="MRK 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 12:16" />Cun ngun tangka cu an pe ih an sinah, “Hihi hutu ih muihmel a si ih, zangtu thu a ngan fa?” tiah a sut hnei.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 12:16">Anni nih, “Caesar ih,” tiah an ti.<verse eid="MRK 12:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 12:17" />Cule Jesuh nih an sinah, “Caesar ih thil pawl cu Caesar sinah pe uh, cule Pathian ih thil pawl cu Pathian pe uh,” tiah a ti.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 12:17">Cun Jesuh cungah an mang a bang ngai.<verse eid="MRK 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mithi Thawhsalnak Thu Thusuhnak</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:23-33">Matthai 22.23–33</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:27-40">Luka 20.27–40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 12:18" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12.18 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 23:8">Forh 23.8</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Cun Jesuh sinah thawhsalnak a um lo titu Sadusi pawl an tiang ih thu an sut. <verse eid="MRK 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 12:19" />“Sayapa, Moses nih, ‘mi pakhat cu fa nei loʼn a nupi a thihtak asihle a unau pa nih cuvai nuhmei cu a ṭhi thok ih, a unau pa ih hrangah ci a thlahsak thok,’ tiah kan na ngansak. <verse eid="MRK 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 12:20" />Cun unau pasarih an um, uta bik nih nupi a ṭhi ih fa nei loʼn a thi. <verse eid="MRK 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 12:21" />Cule a panihnak pa nih cuvai nu cu a ṭhi ih fa nei loʼn a thi ve. Cun a pathumnak pa khaw cumang thotho in a cang. <verse eid="MRK 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 12:22" />Cule an pasarih in fa nei loʼn an thi colh. Neta bik ah numi nu khaw a thi ve. <verse eid="MRK 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 12:23" />Curuangah thawhsalnak ih an thawhsal tikah, hutu bik ih nupi a si thok? An pasarih in nupi ah an ṭhi vek sikhaw?” tiah an sut.<verse eid="MRK 12:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 12:24" />Jesuh nih an sinah, “Pathian ih cahnak huham le Ca Thianghlim nan fiah lo ruangah nan sual a i lo maw? <verse eid="MRK 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 12:25" />Zangahtihle thihnak in an thawhsal tikah, an ṭhi fa i thok lo, ṭhitfaknak khaw a um i thok lo ih, vancung ih a ummi vancungmi pawl mang an i thok. <verse eid="MRK 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 12:26" />Cun mithi thawhsalnak thu ah, hrambur sung in Pathian nih Moses sinah, ‘Kei cu Abraham ih Pathian, Isak ih Pathian, le Jakob ih Pathian ka si,’ a tihmi Moses cabu khi nan siar kel lo maw? <verse eid="MRK 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 12:27" />Ani cu a thimi pawl ih Pathian a i lo, a nungmi pawl ih Pathian a i sawn. Curuangah nan ruatsual ngai,” tiah a ti hnei.<verse eid="MRK 12:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">A Thupi Bikmi Thupek</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:34-40">Matthai 22.34–40</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:25-28">Luka 10.25–28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 12:28" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12.28–34 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 10:25-28">Luk 10.25–28</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Cun daanthiam pawl lakih mi pakhat cu a tiang ih, thu an relmi cu a ngai. Cule Jesuh nih ṭha tukin a sawn hnei thiam tih a hmuh tikah, “Thupek hmahhmah lakah khoitu hi a thupi bik?” tiah a sut.<verse eid="MRK 12:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 12:29" />Jesuh nih, “A thupi bikmi Thupek cu: ‘Maw Israel, ngai hnik, Bawipa kan Pathian, Bawipa cu pakhat a i.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12.29 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Bawipa kan Pathian, Bawipa cu pakhat a i; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">loleh </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Bawipa kan Pathian kau lawng hi Bawipa a i.</char></note> <verse eid="MRK 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 12:30" />Cun Bawipa na Pathian cu na thinlung zateʼn, na nunnak zateʼn, na ruahnak zaten le na cahnak zaten na duhdawt thok,’ tihhi a i. <verse eid="MRK 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 12:31" />Cun a panihnak cu: ‘Nangma le nangma na duhdawt fak mangin na inn kiangveng pawl na duhdawt thok,’ tihhi a i. Hi thupek pawl nakih thupi sawn thupek a um lo,” tiah a sawn.<verse eid="MRK 12:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 12:32" />Cule daanthiam pa nih a sinah, “Sayapa, na sipmi cu a ṭha. Thudik na sim, zangahtihle Pathian pakhat kau a um, ani siarlo pathian dang an um lo. <verse eid="MRK 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 12:33" />Cun thinlung zate, fiahthiamnak zate, cahnak zate thawn ama Pathian duhdawt, le ma le ma duhdawt fak mangin inn kiangveng pawl duhdawt cu meihul thawinak le thawinak dangdang pawl nakin a thupi sawn,” tiah a sawn.<verse eid="MRK 12:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 12:34" />Cun Jesuh nih, cupa nih fing ngaiin a let, tih a hmuh tikah, a sinah, “Pathian uknak thawn nan hlat fa lo,” tiah a ti.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 12:34">Cuvai hnuk cu hukhaw nih thu an sut ngam i lo.<verse eid="MRK 12:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Khrih Thu Thusuhnak</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:41-46">Matthai 22.41–46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:41-44">Luka 20.41–44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 12:35" />Cun Jesuh cu biakinn songah thu a zirh. Jesuh nih, “Zangtin daanthiam pawl nih Khrih cu David ih fapa a si, tiah an ti thiam? <verse eid="MRK 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 12:36" />David ama rori nih Thlarau Thianghlim hmangin:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:36">“ ‘Bawipa nih ka Bawipa sinah:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 12:36">Na ral pawl na ke tangih ka siah hlan lo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 12:36">Ka vorh la ah to,’ tiah a ti.<verse eid="MRK 12:36" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 12:37" />A ma David rori hman nih ani cu ‘Bawipa’ tiah a ko. Curuangah zangtin a fapa cu a si thiam thok?” tiah a ti.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="MRK 12:37">Jesuh nih Daanthiam pawl Ralrinnak A Pe</para>
  <para style="r" vid="MRK 12:37">(<ref loc="MAT 23:1-36">Matthai 23.1–36</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:45-47">Luka 20.45–47</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 12:37">Cule mipi tam ngai nih Jesuh ih thuzirhmi cu lungawi ngaiin an ngai. <verse eid="MRK 12:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 12:38" />Cun a thuzirhnak ah Jesuh nih, “Daanthiam pawl khi ralring uh, an ni cu angki fual thawn tawivah an duh ih dawr tluan ah cibai buk an duh. <verse eid="MRK 12:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 12:39" />Cule Sinakok ah tonak ṭhabik ah to an duh ih puai tuahnak ah upatnak hmun ih to an duh. <verse eid="MRK 12:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 12:40" />Nuhmei pawl ih inn an long ih, mi deuhnak ah rei ngaingai in thla an cam fa ter. Hipawl hi thuṭhennak nasa sawn an tuar thok,” tiah a ti.<verse eid="MRK 12:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nuhmei ih Thawhhlawm</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 21:1-4">Luka 21.1–4</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 12:41" />Cun Jesuh cu thawhhlawm bawm zawn ah a to ih, mipi nih thawhhlawm bawm sungah zangti in tangka an ṭhil, tih a zoh. Milian pawl nih tangka tamngai an ṭhil. <verse eid="MRK 12:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 12:42" />Cun nuhmei fahrah pakhat a tiang ih dar tangka pia nih a ṭhil ve. <verse eid="MRK 12:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 12:43" />Cule a dungthluntu pawl cu a ko hnei ih an sinah, “Thutak in nan ta sim, hivai nuhmei fahrah nu hi thawhhlawm bawm sungih a ṭhiltu dang pawl hmahhmah nakin tamsawn a ṭhil. <verse eid="MRK 12:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 12:44" />Zangahtihle midang pawl hmahhmah cu an neih hleifuanmi an pe; asinain ani cu a fahrah ngai na in — a nunkhaw saknak ding ih a neihmi zatein a ṭhil colh,” tiah a ti.<verse eid="MRK 12:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="MRK 13" />
  <para style="s">Jesuh nih Jerusalem Biakinn Siatnak Thu A Sim</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:1-2">Matthai 24.1–2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:5-6">Luka 21.5–6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 13:1" />Cun Jesuh cu Biakinn songin a suah fangah, a dungthluntu pawl lakih mi pakhat nih a sinah, “Zoh hnih, Sayapa, hivai lung pawl le inn pawl hi maktak uh e!” tiah a ti.<verse eid="MRK 13:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 13:2" />Cule Jesuh nih a sinah, “Hi inn mak tara pawl hi na hmu kau lo maw? Hi lung pakhat cungah lung dang pakhat hman tang lo in hlon colh a i leh thok,” tiah a sim.<verse eid="MRK 13:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Harsatnak pawl le Hremnak pawl</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:3-14">Matthai 24.3–14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:7-19">Luka 21.7–19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 13:3" />Jesuh cu Biakinn la hoi in Olif Tlang cungih a to laiah, Peter, James, Johan le Andru nih a thupte in an pha ih, <verse eid="MRK 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 13:4" />“Cuvai thil pawl cu khawtikah a tiang thok ih, a tian ni a nai tikah zangtu hmuhsaknak pawl a um thok?” tiah an sut.<verse eid="MRK 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 13:5" />Cule Jesuh nih an sinah, “Mi ih nan ta deuh eng lonak dingah ralring uh. <verse eid="MRK 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 13:6" />Mi tamngai ka hmin in an tiang thok ih, ‘Kei hi ani ka si!’ tiah an ti thok ih mi tamngai an deu thok. <verse eid="MRK 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 13:7" />Cun dohfaknak thu le ral dawhnak thuthang pawl nan theih tikah nan thinphang hlah uh. Cumang thil pawl cu a cang hrimhrim thokmi an i, asinain a netnak cu a tiang rih lo. <verse eid="MRK 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 13:8" />Zangahtihle miphun pakhat le pakhat, ram khat le ram khat an do fa thok. Cule hmun dangdang ah ling a hnin thok ih mangṭam a tlung thok. Cuvai pawl cu nauneih thokih pumfah mang a i thok.<verse eid="MRK 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 13:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13.9–11 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 10:17-20">Mat 10.17–20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:11">Luk 12.11</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 12:12">12</ref></char>
    </note>“Asinain nanma hrimhrim ralring uh. Zangahtihle nan ta tlai eng thok ih khonsil ah nan ta fehpit thok; Sinakok sungah nan ta thawivel eng thok; cule ka thuhla fiahpittu dingah keimaiʼ ruangah uktu pawl le siangpahrang hmai ah nan ding thok. <verse eid="MRK 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 13:10" />Cule thuthang ṭha cu miphun zate sinah sipphuan hmasak a i thok. <verse eid="MRK 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 13:11" />Cun nan ta tlai eng ih mi kut nan tian tikah, zangtu ka ṭon thok tiah khawruahhar cia hlah uh. Asinain cuvai tikcu can ih nan sinih sipmi hmahhmah kau ṭon uh. Zangahtihle a ṭontu cu nan, nan i lo, Thlarau Thianghlim sawn a i. <verse eid="MRK 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 13:12" />Cule unau le unau khaw thihnak tiang khop in an phatsan fa thok ih, pa nih fa, cun fale nih nu le pa pawl an dodal thok ih thihnak tiang an suah fa thok. <verse eid="MRK 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 13:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:22">Mat 10.22</ref></char></note>Cun ka hmin ruangah mi hmahhmah nih nan ta hua eng thok. Asinain a net tiang a tuarsuaktu cu rundam a i thok.<verse eid="MRK 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tuksumza Thil Borhhlawh</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:15-28">Matthai 24.15–28</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:20-24">Luka 21.20–24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 13:14" />“Cun ‘Tuksumza Thil Borhhlawh’ cu a din lonak ding hmun ih a din nan hmu thok.” (A siartu nih cingthiam seh!) “Cule Judea peng ih a um mi pawl cu tlang cung ah zuang seu. <verse eid="MRK 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 13:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.15–16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 17:31">Luk 17.31</ref></char></note>Inn tlun diphun ih a um mi cu rong ṭum pit in thil la dingah inn song ah lut hlah seh. <verse eid="MRK 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 13:16" />Cule lo ih a um mi khaw a hnipuan la dingah a inn ah tlung hlah seh. <verse eid="MRK 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 13:17" />Cuvai can cu farai pawl le nau hnawi fawp nei pawl hrangah cu a har setak thok. <verse eid="MRK 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 13:18" />Cuvai can cu isik can ah cang lo dingin thla cam uh. <verse eid="MRK 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 13:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 7:14">Thup 7.14</ref></char></note>Zangahtihle cuvai ni ah cun Pathian nih leilung a semsuah tir in a tun tiangah a um dah kel lomi, leh a um sal i nawn thok lo mi harsatnak a um thok. <verse eid="MRK 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 13:20" />Cun cuvai ni cu Bawipa nih a tawiter lo ahcun zangmang minung khaw an luat thok lo. Asinain a hril hleice mi pawl hrangah cuvai ni cu a tawiter thok.<verse eid="MRK 13:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 13:21" />“Cun mi pakhat khat nih, ‘Zohhnik uh, Khrih cu hiva a um!’ lole ‘Zohhnik uh, Khrih cu khiva ah a um,’ tiah nan ta ti eng khawah — zum hlah uh! <verse eid="MRK 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 13:22" />Zangahtihle khrih deu pawl le profet deu pawl an suak thok ih mi an deuh theinak dingah hmuhsaknak pawl le mangbangza thil pawl an tuah thok, a canthei ahcun hril mi pawl hman an deu thok. <verse eid="MRK 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 13:23" />Asinain ralring uh; ai hlan in thil hmahhmah nan ta sim cia cem.<verse eid="MRK 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Minung Fapa Tiannak Thu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:29-31">Matthai 24.29–31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:25-28">Luka 21.25–28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 13:24" />“Asinain cuvai ni ahcun, cuvai harsatnak a tian hnukah, ni cu a mawk thok ih thlapa khaw a vang thok lo. <verse eid="MRK 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 13:25" />Cun vancung in arsi pawl an ṭil thok ih vancung huham cahnak pawl khaw an hnin colh thok. <verse eid="MRK 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 13:26" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 1:7">Thup 1.7</ref></char></note>Cun mi nih huham cahnak le sunlawinak thawn Minung Fapa khawdur lakin a rong ṭum cu an hmu thok. <verse eid="MRK 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 13:27" />Cule a vancungmi pawl a thlah hnei thok ih Leilung kil li ih a hril mi pawl cu lei taw deng ihsin van deng tiang a khawlkhawm hnei thok.<verse eid="MRK 13:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Thei Kuang sinih Zirnak</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:32-35">Matthai 24.32–35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:29-33">Luka 21.29–33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 13:28" />“Thei kuang tahṭhipnak in zir uh. A tlang note an hang suak ih a hnah a cerh tikah ṭhal can a nai tih nan fiah. <verse eid="MRK 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 13:29" />Cumang thotho in, himang thil pawl a tian nan hmuh tikah tikcu can a nai i, kotka hram a ban i,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13.29 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">tikcu can a nai i, kotka hram a ban i; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">loleh </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">ani cu naite ah a um, tiang dingin a manfa.</char></note> tih fiah uh. <verse eid="MRK 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 13:30" />Thutakin nan ta sim, hivai thil pawl a kim lai hlan lo, tun san minung pawl hi an loral thok lo. <verse eid="MRK 13:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 13:31" />Van le leilung cu an loral thok, asinain ka ṭonkam pawl cu an loral kel thok lo.<verse eid="MRK 13:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hutu Khaw nih A Ni le Can An Fiah Lo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:36-44">Matthai 24.36–44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 13:32" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13.32 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 24:36">Mat 24.36</ref>
      </char>
    </note>“Asinain cuvai ni le can cu hutukhaw nih an fiah lo — van ih vancungmi pawl khaw nih an fiah lo, Fapa khaw nih a fiah lo; Pa kau nih a fiah. <verse eid="MRK 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 13:33" />Nanma hrimhrim ah ralring uh, thengvar zikzik uh. Zangahtihle khawtikah a cang thok tih nan fiah lo. <verse eid="MRK 13:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 13:34" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 12:36-38">Luk 12.36–38</ref> </char></note>Zangtu thawn a ṭiahfa tihle, mi pakhat a inn ramta in khual tlawn dingih a pawh tikah, a sinum pawl sinah thuneihnak le an ṭuanvo vek ṭhaten a peta hnei ih kotka kiltu khaw ihhmul lo in thengvar ringring dingin thu a cah ta tu pa mang khi a i. <verse eid="MRK 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 13:35" />Curuangah thengvar ringring uh, zangahtihle inn neitu cu zan ah maw, zanruang ah maw, zing arkhuan can ah maw, zingmaw ah maw — khawtikah a tiang thok tih nan fiah lo. <verse eid="MRK 13:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 13:36" />Culole rinlopiʼn a tiang ih nan ihhmulh lai nan ta hmu pang thok. <verse eid="MRK 13:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 13:37" />Cun nan sinih ka sipmi thu hi mi hmahhmah sin khaw ah ka sim: thengvar in ralring uh,” tiah a ti.<verse eid="MRK 13:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="MRK 14" />
  <para style="s">Jesuh That dingin an Tawlrel</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:1-5">Matthai 26.1–5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:1-2">Luka 22.1–2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 11:45-53">Johan 11.45–53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 14:1" />Lantak Puai le Colh tello Sang Puai kim ding cu ni nih kau a duh. Puithiam upa pawl le daanthiam pawl nih Jesuh cu a thupten tlaih thei dan ding le thah thei dan ding an hrawl. <verse eid="MRK 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 14:2" />Asinain, “Puai can ah cu i hlah seh, mipi pawl an buai pang thok,” tiah an ti.<verse eid="MRK 14:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bethani Khua ah Jesuh Hriak An Burh</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:6-13">Matthai 26.6–13</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:1-8">Johan 12.1–8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 14:3" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14.3 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 7:37">Luk 7.37</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 7:38">38</ref></char>
    </note>Cun Jesuh cu Bethani khua, pharfah a tuar tadahtu Simon inn ah a um ih caw a ei lai ah, a man khung ngaimi le a thianghlim mi nard zihmui cu alabaster lung ih tuahmi thawl thawn kengta pit in numi nu pakhat cu a tiang. Cuvai thawl cu a phak ih nard zihmui cu Jesuh ih lu ah a burh. <verse eid="MRK 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 14:4" />Mi hrekkhat cu an thin a se ih, “Zangruangah hi hriak rimhmui cu a riaral ter men? <verse eid="MRK 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 14:5" />Zangahtihle hivai hriak cu Ngun tangka<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14.5 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Ngun tangka: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">6.37 ah zoh.</char></note> zathum nakih tam ah zuar pitin mi fahrah pek sawn thok a i naʼn,” tiah an ti. Cule numi nu cu an mawhthluk.<verse eid="MRK 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 14:6" />Asinain Jesuh nih, “A ma ten umter uh. Zangruangah numi nu cu nan hnaihnok ngelngo? Ani nih ka cungah thil ṭha a tuah. <verse eid="MRK 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 14:7" />Zangahtihle mi fahrah pawl cu nan sin an um reuhro thok ih, nan duh tik poh ah an cungah thil ṭha nan tuah thei. Asinain kei cu nan sinah ka um reuhro thok lo. <verse eid="MRK 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 14:8" />Ani nih a tuah thei tawk a tuah cem. Ka na phumnak ding hrangah ka taksa ruangpum hriak a culh cia mi a i. <verse eid="MRK 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 14:9" />Cun thutak in nan ta sim, thuthang ṭha an sipnak leilung pumpuluk ah hivai a tuahmi thu hi ama hmulhlonak ah an sim reuhro thok,” tiah a ti.<verse eid="MRK 14:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Judas nih Jesuh Zuar dingin A Lungkim</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:14-16">Matthai 26.14–16</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:3-6">Luka 22.3–6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 14:10" />Cun dungthluntu lakih pakhat Judas Iskariot cu Jesuh zuar dingin puithiam upa pawl sinah a feh. <verse eid="MRK 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 14:11" />Cule puithiam upa pawl nih cuvai thu an theih tikah, an lung a awi ngai ih tangka pe dingin thu an kam. Cule Judas cu Jesuh zuar ding can remcang a hrawl.<verse eid="MRK 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesuh Cu A Dungthluntu pawl thawn Lantak Puai Zanriah An Ei</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:17-25">Matthai 26.17–25</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:7-14">Luka 22.7–14</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 22:21-23">21–23</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:21-30">Johan 13.21–30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 14:12" />Cun Colh Telhlo Sang Puai, ni khatnak, Lantak Puai thawinak hrang tuu fa no thah ni ah, a dungthluntu pawl nih Jesuh sinah, “Lantak Puai caw cu khoitu ah ta timtuah sak nung la na duh?” tiah an sut.<verse eid="MRK 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 14:13" />Cule a dungthluntu pawl lakih mi panih cu a hei thlah ih an sinah, “Khawpi sungah feh uhla tithawl cawitu pa thawn nan hmu fa thok, cule ani cu thlun uh. <verse eid="MRK 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 14:14" />Cun khoitu inn ih a luh khaw ah, a luhnak inn ih inntek sinah, ‘Sayapa nih, ka dungthluntu pawl thawn Lantak Puai caw kan einak ding mikhual khan cu khoitu hi a si? a ti,’ tiah sut uh. <verse eid="MRK 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 14:15" />Cule ani nih timtuah ciami tlunta khan hnempi nan ta hmuh thok, cuva cu kan hrangah timtuah uh,” tiah a ti.<verse eid="MRK 14:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 14:16" />Cun dungthluntu pawl cu an pok ih khawpi sung ah an feh. Jesuh ih a sipcia mangin an va hmu. Cule Lantak Puai zanriah an timtuah.<verse eid="MRK 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 14:17" />Cun simla a phak tikah Jesuh cu dungthluntu hleinih pawl thawn an va feh. <verse eid="MRK 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 14:18" />Cule cabuai ih caw an ei lai ah Jesuh nih, “Thutak in nan ta sim, nan lakih mi pakhat — kei thawn caw a ei khat tu — nih ka na zuar thok,” tiah a ti hnei.<verse eid="MRK 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 14:19" />Dungthluntu pawl cu an riah a se ngai ih pakhat hnuk pakhat in, “Kei ka si maw?” tiah an ti.<verse eid="MRK 14:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 14:20" />Jesuh nih an sinah, “Dungthluntu hleinih lakih mi pakhat, kei thawn kheng pakhat sungih sang a hnimtu hi a si. <verse eid="MRK 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 14:21" />Minung Fapa cu, a thuhla ngancia mangin, a feh taktak thok. Asinain Minung Fapa a zuartu pa cu a lamka a pit. Suak lo lawlaw in um sehla a hrangah cun a ṭha sawn thok naʼn!” tiah a ti.<verse eid="MRK 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bawipa ih Zanriah</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:26-30">Matthai 26.26–30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:14-20">Luka 22.14–20</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 11:23-25">1 Korin 11.23–25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 14:22" />Cun caw an ei laiah, Jesuh nih sang cu a la, thlawsuah a pek hnukah a ṭhek ih a dungthluntu pawl sin a pe hnei, “La uh la ei uh, hihi ka taksa a si,” tiah a ti.<verse eid="MRK 14:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 14:23" />Cule khuat cu a la ih lungawithu a sip hnukah a pe hnei ih an zaten an ding. <verse eid="MRK 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 14:24" />Cun Jesuh nih an sinah, “Hihi mi tamngai hrangah ka thletmi, ka thisen ih thukam a i. <verse eid="MRK 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 14:25" />Thutakin nan ta sim, Pathian Uknak sungih sabit ti thar ka din sal lai hlan lo hivai sabitti cu ka ding i thok lo,” tiah a ti.<verse eid="MRK 14:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 14:26" />Cule hla an sa ih Olif Tlang ah an feh.<verse eid="MRK 14:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesuh nih Peter ih Phatsannak ding A Sim Cia</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:31-35">Matthai 26.31–35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:31-34">Luka 22.31–34</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:36-38">Johan 13.36–38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 14:27" />Cun Jesuh nih an sinah, “Nan zaten ka na zuangta colh thok ih ka na ramta eng thok. Zangahtihle ‘Tuukhal cu ka thawi thok ih, tuu pawl cu an ṭhekdarh colh thok,’ tiah ca thianghlim ah ngan a i. <verse eid="MRK 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 14:28" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14.28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 28:16">Mat 28.16</ref></char></note>Asinain ka thawhsal hnukah Galilee ah nan hmai ah ka feh thok,” tiah a ti.<verse eid="MRK 14:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 14:29" />Peter nih a sinah, “Midang pawl nih ta zuangta colh khaw seula, kei cu ka zuang thok lo,” tiah a ti.<verse eid="MRK 14:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 14:30" />Cule Jesuh nih a sinah, “Thutak in nan ta sim, nihin zan ah, ar vei nih a khuan hlanah vei thum ka na phatsan thok,” tiah a ti.<verse eid="MRK 14:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 14:31" />Asinain Peter nih nasa hlehhlo in, “Nang thawn thi ding i hman ningla, ta phatsan hrimhrim thok lo,” tiah a ti.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 14:31">A dang pawl khaw nih cutin an ti ve.<verse eid="MRK 14:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesuh Cu Gethsemane ah Thla A Cam</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:36-46">Matthai 26.36–46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:39-46">Luka 22.39–46</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 14:32" />Cun Gethsemane tihmi hmun an va ban ih Jesuh nih a dungthluntu pawl sinah, “Thla ka cam sung aiva hi to khan uh,” tiah a ti. <verse eid="MRK 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 14:33" />Cule Peter, James le Johan cu a sinah a ṭhi ta hnei. Jesuh cu khuaruahhar le vansang ngai in a um ih, <verse eid="MRK 14:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 14:34" />an sinah, “Ka thinlung hi thihnak tlak khop in rauh ngai a riah a se. Hiva ah si khan uh la ka hngak uh,” tiah a ti.<verse eid="MRK 14:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 14:35" />Cun hmunhla deuh ah a feh ih leilung ah a bok, cule a canthiam a sih ahcun cuvai can cu ka sin in lan ter, tiah thla a cam. <verse eid="MRK 14:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 14:36" />Cule, “<char style="tl">Abba</char>, ka Pa, na hrangah cun zang hmahhmah a cangthei colh. Hivai khuat hi ka sin in la hram. Asinain ka duh mangin i hlah seh, na duh mangin i sawn seh,” tiah a ti.<verse eid="MRK 14:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 14:37" />Cun Jesuh cu a dungthluntu pawl sinah a kir sal ih an ihhmulh khi a hmu. Cule Peter sinah, “Simon, na ihhmul maw? Nazi pakhat te hman ka na hngak thei lo maw? <verse eid="MRK 14:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 14:38" />Tukforhnak ih nan luh lonak dingah ihhmul loʼn hngak uh la thla cam uh. Thlarau nih a duh naʼn taksa cu a ṭawnṭai!” tiah a ti.<verse eid="MRK 14:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 14:39" />Cule Jesuh cu a feh sal ih a hmasa mang thotho in thla a cam sal. <verse eid="MRK 14:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 14:40" />Cun a kir sal sei ih an ihhmulh cu a hmu hnei sei, zangahtihle an mit a rit tuk. Zangtin kan sawn sal thok tih khaw an fiah lo.<verse eid="MRK 14:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 14:41" />A vei thumnak a kir sal ih an sinah, “Nan ihhmul rih thotho a si maw? Nan cawlhnga rih zikzik maw? A tawk i. A tikcu a kim i. Minung Fapa cu misual pawl kut sungah zuar a i cem. <verse eid="MRK 14:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 14:42" />Tho uh, feh u sing. Zohhnik uh, ka na zuartu pa a ban i,” tiah a ti.<verse eid="MRK 14:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesuh An Tlai</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:47-56">Matthai 26.47–56</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:47-53">Luka 22.47–53</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:3-12">Johan 18.3–12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 14:43" />Cun a ṭon berbo laiah, hmakhatte ah, dungthluntu hleinih lakih pakhat, Judas cu puithiam upa pawl, daanthiam pawl le mi upa pawl ih thlahmi talhvawng le ralnam keng miburpi thawn an tiang <verse eid="MRK 14:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 14:44" />Mi zuartu pa nih, “Ka hnap thokmi pa cu nan tlaih duhmi pa a i. Tlai uhla ṭhaten kil pit in ṭhi ta uh,” tiah hminhlitnak a pe hnei cia.<verse eid="MRK 14:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 14:45" />Judas cu a tian cang in Jesuh sin a feh lohli ih, “Rabbi,” tiah a ti ih a hnam. <verse eid="MRK 14:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 14:46" />Cun Jesuh cu an tlai ih an khit. <verse eid="MRK 14:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 14:47" />Asinain cuvai hmun ih a dingtu mi pakhat nih ralnam a zuk ih puithiam lubik ih sinum paiʼ nakawr cu ṭot in a sat. <verse eid="MRK 14:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 14:48" />Cule Jesuh nih an sinah, “Damiah tlai ding mangin ralnam le talhvawng thawn ka na tlai dingah maw nan tiang? <verse eid="MRK 14:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 14:49" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14.49 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 19:47">Luk 19.47</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:37">21.37</ref> </char></note>Biakinn ah thu zirh in ni cangcang nan sinah ka um ih ka na tlai eng lo. Asinain Ca Thianghlim cu a kim a ṭul,” tiah a ti.<verse eid="MRK 14:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 14:50" />Cule a dungthluntu pawl nih an ramta ih an zuangta colh.<verse eid="MRK 14:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 14:51" />Cun puan pate kau a sinmi tlangval pakhat nih Jesuh cu a thlun. Ani khaw cu an tlai ve. <verse eid="MRK 14:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 14:52" />Asinain a puan pate cu a ramta ih taklawng in a zuang.<verse eid="MRK 14:52" /></para>
  <para style="s">Khonsil hmai ah Jesuh</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:57-68">Matthai 26.57–68</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:54-55">Luka 22.54–55</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 22:63-71">63–71</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:13-14">Johan 18.13–14</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 18:19-24">19–24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MRK 14:53" />Cun Jesuh cu Puithiam lubik sinah an ṭhi ta ih puithiam upa pawl, mi upa pawl le daanthiam pawl cu an hmuakkhawm fa. <verse eid="MRK 14:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MRK 14:54" />Cule Peter nih lam hlat nawn in puithiam upa ih tualhma tiang a thlun. Cule siahhlawh pawl sinah a to ih meisa a ai ve. <verse eid="MRK 14:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MRK 14:55" />Puithiam upa pawl le khonsil upa pawl cu Jesuh thah theinak ding thu fiahpittu an hrawl, asinain an hmu lo. <verse eid="MRK 14:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MRK 14:56" />Zangahtihle mi tamngai nih fiahpitnak diklo thawn sual an puh, asinain an thu a rual fa thiam lo.<verse eid="MRK 14:56" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="MRK 14:57" />Cun mi hrekkhat cu an ding ih, fiahpitnak diklo thawn sual an puh, <verse eid="MRK 14:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MRK 14:58" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14.58 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 2:19">Joh 2.19</ref> </char></note> “Hi pa ih ṭonmi kan thei, ‘Minung ih sakmi hivai Biakinn hi ka siatbal thok ih ni thum sungah kut ih sak lo mi a dang pakhat ka sa thok,’ a ti,” tiah an ti. <verse eid="MRK 14:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="MRK 14:59" />Asinain cuvai an fiahpitnak thu khaw cu an rual fa thiam cuang lo.<verse eid="MRK 14:59" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="MRK 14:60" />Cun Puithiam Lubik cu an lai fangah a hang ding ih, Jesuh sinah, “Zangkhaw na let hnei thok lo maw? Hi pawl nih ta dokalh in fiahpitnak thu an sipmi hi zangtin a si?” tiah a sut.<verse eid="MRK 14:60" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="MRK 14:61" />Asinain Jesuh cu daiten a um ih zangkhaw a sawn lo. Puithiam Lubik nih, “Nang hi sunloihmi Pathian ih Fapa Khrih cu na si maw?” tiah a sut sal.<verse eid="MRK 14:61" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="MRK 14:62" />Cule Jesuh nih, “Ka si, Minung Fapa cu Huham Cahnak neitu ih vorh la ah to in vancung ih khawdur pawl thawn a tian khaw na hmu leh thok,” tiah a ti.<verse eid="MRK 14:62" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="MRK 14:63" />Cule Puithiam Lubik cu a hnipuan a phat ih, “Fiahpittu dang kan ṭul bet i maw? <verse eid="MRK 14:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="MRK 14:64" />Pathian a thangsiat zia cu nan thei vek cem. Zangtin nan ruat?” tiah a ti.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 14:64">Cule an zaten Jesuh cu thi tlak hrimhrim a i tiah mawh an puh.<verse eid="MRK 14:64" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" sid="MRK 14:65" />Cun mi hrekkhat nih cihrit an khak, a hmai an hup ih an thawng. Cule, “Hutu nih ta thawng? Kan sim hnik,” tiah an ti. Cun siahhlawh pawl nih an beng.<verse eid="MRK 14:65" /></para>
  <para style="s">Peter nih Jesuh A Phatsan</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:69-75">Matthai 26.69–75</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:56-62">Luka 22.56–62</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:15-18">Johan 18.15–18</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 18:25-27">25–27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="MRK 14:66" />Cun Peter cu tualhma ih a um lai ah Puithiam Lubik ih siahhlawh pawl lak in numi pakhat cu a sinah a tiang. <verse eid="MRK 14:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="MRK 14:67" />Cule cuvai nu nih Peter meisa a aih lai cu a hmuh tikah a zoh ih, “Nang khaw Nazareth mi Jesuh thawn umkhatmi na si ve,” tiah a ti.<verse eid="MRK 14:67" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="MRK 14:68" />Asinain Peter nih a el ih, “Ka fiah lo, zangtu na ṭon tih khaw ka fiah lo,” tiah a ti ih kotka la ah a feh. Cule ar a khuang.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14.68 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">A hrekkhat kutngan cabu pawl sungah cu </char><char style="fq" closed="false">cule ar a khuang; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">a um lo.</char></note><verse eid="MRK 14:68" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="MRK 14:69" />Cun siahhlawh nu nih a va hmu seisei ih, a hram ih a dingtu pawl sinah, “Hi pa hi an lakih telmi a i,” tiah a ti. <verse eid="MRK 14:69" /><verse number="70" style="v" sid="MRK 14:70" />Asinain Peter nih a el seisei.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 14:70">Cun tawite rei hnukah, Peter cu a hram ih dingtu pawl nih, “Nang khaw hi an lakih mi pakhat na si rori, zangahtihle Galilee mi na i,” tiah an ti.<verse eid="MRK 14:70" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="MRK 14:71" />Cule Peter nih siatcam in thu a kam ih, “Nan sipmi pa hi hutu a si tih ka fiah hrimhrim lo,” tiah a ti.<verse eid="MRK 14:71" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="MRK 14:72" />Cun hmakhatte ah a vei nihnak ar a khuang. Cule Peter cu Jesuh nih, “Ar vei nih khuang hlanah vei thum tiang ka na phatsan thok,” tih a sipmi cu a cing sal. Cun Peter cu a riahse in a ṭap.<verse eid="MRK 14:72" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="MRK 15" />
  <para style="s">Pilat Hmai ah Jesuh</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:1-2">Matthai 27.1–2</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 27:11-14">11–14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:1-5">Luka 23.1–5</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:28-38">Johan 18.28–38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 15:1" />Cun zingmaw ngaiah puithiam upa pawl cu Judah mi upa pawl, daanthiam pawl, le khonsil upa pawl thawn thurel khawmnak an tuah lohli. Jesuh cu hri in an khit ih Pilat sinah an ṭhita. <verse eid="MRK 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 15:2" />Cun Pilat nih, “Judah siangpahrang na si maw?” tiah a sut.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 15:2">Cule Jesuh nih, “Nang nih na ti,” tiah a sawn.<verse eid="MRK 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 15:3" />Cule puithiam upa pawl nih Jesuh cu sual a phunphun an puh. <verse eid="MRK 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 15:4" />Curuangah Pilat nih, “Zangkhaw na sawn hnei thok lo maw? Ta zuarthlainak liangluang hi ngai hnik,” tiah a ti.<verse eid="MRK 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 15:5" />Asinain Jesuh nih zangkhaw a sawn hnei lo ruangah Pilat cu a mang a bang.<verse eid="MRK 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesuh Cu That dingin An Relcat</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:15-26">Matthai 27.15–26</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:13-25">Luka 23.13–25</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:39-19:16">Johan 18.39—19.16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 15:6" />Lantak Puai cangcang ah Pilat nih mipi ih an dilmi thawngtla pakhat a suahsak hnei ringring. <verse eid="MRK 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 15:7" />Culai ah Barabbas an tihmi pa, ralthawh lai ah mi a thattu pa cu, ral thotu dang pawl thawn thawng an tla. <verse eid="MRK 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 15:8" />Cun mipi pawl cu a tuahkel mangin tuah dingah Pilat sin an tiang ih an hler. <verse eid="MRK 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 15:9" />Asinain Pilat nih a sawn hnei ih, “Judah Siangpahrang hi thlah ningla nan duh maw?” tiah a ti. <verse eid="MRK 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 15:10" />Zangahtihle puithiam upa pawl nih an nahsuah ruangah, a kut ah an tianpit, tih a fiah.<verse eid="MRK 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 15:11" />Asinain Barabbas sawn suah dingah puithiam upa pawl nih mipi pawl cu an forh cia. <verse eid="MRK 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 15:12" />Cun Pilat nih a sut hnei sal ih, “Asihle Judah siangpahrang nan tihmi pa hi zangtin ka tuah ding nan duh?” tiah a ti.<verse eid="MRK 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 15:13" />Cule an ni nih, “Thinglamtah ah that,” tiah an hek sal.<verse eid="MRK 15:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 15:14" />Cun Pilat nih, “Zangruangah, zangtu thil ṭhalo a tuah?” tiah a ti.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 15:14">Asinain an ni nih, “Thinglamtah ah that kau,” tiah an hek hlehhlo.<verse eid="MRK 15:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 15:15" />Pilat cu mipi lungkimter a duh, Barabbas cu an hrangah a thlah. Cule Pilat nih Jesuh cu a thawiter hnei ih thinglamtah ah that dingin an kut ah a pe hnei.<verse eid="MRK 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ralkap pawl nih Jesuh An Zohsuam</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:27-31">Matthai 27.27–31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:2-3">Luka 19.2–3</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 15:16" />Cun ralkap pawl nih Jesuh cu uktu bawi ih tualhma ah an luhpit ih ralkap bur khat khaw an kokhawm. <verse eid="MRK 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 15:17" />Cule Jesuh cu puan sendup an hruksak ih hling ih phiar mi lukhum a lu ah an khumter. <verse eid="MRK 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 15:18" />Cule salam pek an thok ih, “Judah Siangpahrang, upatnak ta pe!” tiah an zohsuam. <verse eid="MRK 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 15:19" />Cun a lu ah fung thawn an thawi, cihrit an khak, an khuk an bil ih a hmai ah an kun. <verse eid="MRK 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 15:20" />Cutin an zohsuam hnukah puan sendup cu an phoihsak ih, ama a hnipuan an hruter, cule thinglamtah ah that dingah an ṭhi ta.<verse eid="MRK 15:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesuh Thinglamtah ah An That</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:32-44">Matthai 27.32–44</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:26-43">Luka 23.26–43</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:17-27">Johan 19.17–27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 15:21" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15.21 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ROM 16:13">Rom 16.13</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Cun khawte ihsin khawpi ih feh, Alexander le Rufus ih pa, Sairin khua mi Simon cu lampi ah an hmu ih, Jesuh ih thinglamtah cu a hramhram in an pu ter. <verse eid="MRK 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 15:22" />Cule Jesuh cu Golgotha tihmi hmun ah an fehpit. Golgotha tih cu “Luruh hmun,” tihnak a i. <verse eid="MRK 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 15:23" />Cun mura thawn nawhmi sabit ti cu an pe, asinain Jesuh nih a ding duh lo. <verse eid="MRK 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 15:24" />Cule thinglamtah ah an khen, a hnipuan cu an phat ih hutu nih zangtu bik a co thok tih fiah dingah camcawhfung zuk pit in an zem fa. <verse eid="MRK 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 15:25" />Jesuh an khet can cu zingmaw nazi pakua a i. <verse eid="MRK 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 15:26" />Cule sual an puhnak catar cu, “Judah Siangpahrang,” tiah a i. <verse eid="MRK 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 15:27" />Jesuh thawn damiah panih, a vorh la ah pakhat, a keh la ah pakhat an khen ve. <verse eid="MRK 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" pubnumber="[28]" sid="MRK 15:28" /><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15.28 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">A hrekkhat kutngan cabu pawl sungah cu afate 28: </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Ca Thianghlim nih “misual lakah ani cu an telhcih,” tihmi a kimnak dingah a i, </char><char style="ft" closed="false">tiah an be (<char style="xt"><ref loc="LUK 22:37">Luk 22.37</ref></char> zoh).</char></note><verse eid="MRK 15:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 15:29" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15.29 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MRK 14:58">Mar 14.58</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 2:19">Joh 2.19</ref></char>
    </note>Cun a hram ih vongva tu pawl nih an thangsiat ih, diriam ngaiin an lu an sut, cule, “Hei! Nang hi Biakinn bal piʼn ni thum sungah a sasaltu khi na si lo maw! <verse eid="MRK 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 15:30" />Nangma le nangma rung fa la thinglamtah cungin rong ṭum,” tiah an ti.<verse eid="MRK 15:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 15:31" />Cumangin puithiam upa pawl le Daanthiam pawl nih Jesuh cu an zohsuam ih, “Midang cu a rung thei, asinain ama le ma cu a rungfa thei lo. <verse eid="MRK 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 15:32" />Israel siangpahrang, Khrih cu a tun rori ah thinglamtah cungin rong ṭum sehla, kan hmu thok ih kan zum thok,” tiah an ti.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 15:32">A ma thawn thinglamtah ih an khet mi pawl khaw nih an zohsuam ve.<verse eid="MRK 15:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesuh ih Thihnak</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:45-56">Matthai 27.45–56</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:44-49">Luka 23.44–49</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:28-30">Johan 19.28–30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 15:33" />Cun sun nazi hleinih a kim ih simla nazi pathum tiang ram pumpuluk ah sunkhawmaw a tlung. <verse eid="MRK 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 15:34" />Cule simla nazi pathum ah Jesuh cu a ṭap ih, <char style="tl">“Eloi, Eloi, lema sabachthani?”</char> tiah thangai in a hek, a sullam cu, “Ka Pathian, ka Pathian, zangah ka na zuangta?” tihnak a i.<verse eid="MRK 15:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 15:35" />Cun a hram ih a ding mi, mi hrekkhat nih an thei ih, “Ngaihnik uh, Elijah a ko,” tiah an ti. <verse eid="MRK 15:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 15:36" />Cule mi pakhat a va zuang ih puansia cu a hangmi sabit ti hang sungah a hnim ih, fung ah hri thawn a khit. Cun din dingah Jesuh sin a pe ih, “Hngak rih hnik uh, thinglamtah cung in ṭhum dingah Elijah a rong maw rong lo kan zoh hnik thok,” tiah a ti hnei.<verse eid="MRK 15:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 15:37" />Cule Jesuh cu thangai in a hek ih a thaw a zom.<verse eid="MRK 15:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 15:38" />Cun biakinn puanzar cu a tlun zim in a tang zim tiang ṭhen nih ah a ṭhen fa. <verse eid="MRK 15:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 15:39" />Jesuh hmaizawn ih a dingtu ralbawipa nih Jesuh ih thihdan<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15.39 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Jesuh ih thihdan; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">a hrekkhat kutngan cabu pawl sungah cu </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Jesuh cu a hek ih a thi, </char><char style="ft" closed="false">tiah a um.</char></note> a hmuh tikah, “Hi pa hi Pathian Fapa rori a i kau e!” tiah a ti.<verse eid="MRK 15:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 15:40" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15.40 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 8:2">Luk 8.2</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 8:3">3</ref></char>
    </note>Cuva ah cun lamhlat nawn in a cuan ve tu numi hrekkhat khaw an um. Cupawl cu Magdala khawnu Mary, James nauta sawn le Joses ih nu Mary, le Salome pawl an i. <verse eid="MRK 15:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 15:41" />Cuvai numi pawl cu Jesuh Galilee peng ih a um laiih a thluntu le a tuamhlawmtu an i. Jesuh thawn Jerusalem ih a feh ve tu numi dang tamngai khaw an tel ve.<verse eid="MRK 15:41" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesuh Phumnak</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:57-61">Matthai 27.57–61</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:50-56">Luka 23.50–56</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:38-42">Johan 19.38–42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 15:42" />Cun cuvai ni cu Sabbath ni phak hlan timtuahfak ni a i. <verse eid="MRK 15:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 15:43" />Zanla a kim tikah, Khonsil upa lak ih upat mi sungtel le Pathian Uknak a hngakhlaptu Arimathea khawmi Josef cu ralṭha ngaiin, Pilat sinah a feh ih, Jesuh ih ruak cu a hler. <verse eid="MRK 15:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 15:44" />Pilat nih Jesuh a thi cem, tih a theih tikah, a mang a bang ngai. Ralbawipa a ko ih, a thihnak rei cem im? tiah a sut. <verse eid="MRK 15:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 15:45" />Ralbawipa sin in Jesuh a thi cem tih a theih tikah a ruak cu Josef a la ter. <verse eid="MRK 15:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 15:46" />Cun Josef cu puan nem pate a lei ih Jesuh ruak cu thinglamtah cung in a ṭhum, cule puan nem pate in a tuam ih lung an vih mi thlan ah a phum. Cun thlanka cu lung thawn in a khar ta. <verse eid="MRK 15:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 15:47" />Magdala khawnu Mary le Joses ih nu Mary nih Jesuh an phumnak cu an hmu.<verse eid="MRK 15:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="MRK 16" />
  <para style="s">Thawhsalnak</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:1-8">Matthai 28.1–8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:1-12">Luka 24.1–12</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:1-10">Johan 20.1–10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 16:1" />Cun Sabbath ni a net tikah, Magdala khawnu Mary, James ih nu Mary le Salome nih Jesuh ruak culh dingah zihmui an lei. <verse eid="MRK 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 16:2" />Zarh khat ih ani khatnak, zingmaw nisuah fangah thlan ah an feh. <verse eid="MRK 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 16:3" />Cule, “Thlanka kharnak lung teh hutu nih kan na thawn sak thok?” tiah pakhat le pakhat an ti fa. <verse eid="MRK 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 16:4" />Cule an zoh ih, lung cu thawn fa cem in an hmu. Cuvai lung cu lung hnempi a i. <verse eid="MRK 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 16:5" />Thlan sungah cu an lut ih angki fual rang a hru mi tlangval pakhat, vorhla kap ih to cu an hmu ih — an thin a phang ngai.<verse eid="MRK 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 16:6" />Ani nih an sinah, “Nan thin phang hlah uh. Thinglamtah ih khenbet mi Nazareth mi Jesuh nan hrawl. Aiva ah a um i lo — thawhtersal a i cem! An siahnak hmun hi zoh hnik hman uh. <verse eid="MRK 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 16:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16.7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 26:32">Mat 26.32</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:28">Mar 14.28</ref></char></note>Feh uhla, ‘nan hmai ah Galilee ah a feh thok, nan ta sip cia mangin cuva ah nan hmu thok,’ tiah a dungthluntu pawl le Peter cu sim uh,” tiah a ti.<verse eid="MRK 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 16:8" />Cule an suak ih thinphang le mangbang in thlan in an zuang. An ṭih tuk ruangah hu sin khaw ah zangkhaw an sim lo.</para>
  <para style="ms" vid="MRK 16:8">Marka Thuthangṭha Netnak Sau<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16.8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">A hrekkhat kutngan cabu pawl le khuahlan Baibal lehmi pawl sungah cu Thuthangṭha sungah hivai a netnak hi a um lo (afate 9–20).</char></note></para>
  <para style="mr" vid="MRK 16:8">
    <ref loc="MRK 16:9-20">16.9–20</ref></para>
  <para style="s" vid="MRK 16:8">Magdala Khawnu Mary sinah Jesuh A Lang</para>
  <para style="r" vid="MRK 16:8">(<ref loc="MAT 28:9-10">Matthai 28.9–10</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:11-18">Johan 20.11–18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 16:8">[ <verse eid="MRK 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 16:9" />Zarh khat ih a ni khatnak zingmaw ah, Jesuh a thosal, khawsia pasarih a dawisuakmi Magdala khawnu Mary sinah a lang hmasabik. <verse eid="MRK 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 16:10" />Magdala khawnu Mary cu Jesuh thawn tlanglengkhat dahmi le riahsia in a ṭap mi pawl sinah a feh ih a sim hnei. <verse eid="MRK 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 16:11" />Asinain Jesuh cu a nung tihmi le Magdala khawnu Mary nih a hmu, tihmi cu an theih tikah an zum lo.<verse eid="MRK 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Dungthluntu Panih sinah Jesuh A Lang</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 24:13-35">Luka 24.13–35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 16:12" />Cuvai hnukah, Jesuh cu dungthluntu panih khawte la ih an feh lai ah phundang in an sinah a lang. <verse eid="MRK 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 16:13" />Cuvai le panih cu an kirsal ih midang pawl sinah an sim, asinain an zum lo.<verse eid="MRK 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Dungthluntu Hleikhat sinah Jesuh A Lang</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:16-20">Matthai 28.16–20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:13-35">Luka 24.13–35</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:19-23">Johan 20.19–23</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:6-8">Forhthlah 1.6–8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 16:14" />Cuvai hnuk ah dungthluntu hleikhat pawl caw an ei lai ah Jesuh cu an sinah a lang. A thawhsal hnuk mi hrekkhat nih an hmuh thu a dungthluntu pawl nih an zum lo ih, an zuplonak le an lungruhnak ruangah a tai hnei. <verse eid="MRK 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 16:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16.15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 1:8">Forh 1.8</ref></char></note>Cun an sinah, “Leilung tlun hmahhmah ah feh uhla, cule serhsiammi zate sinah thuthang ṭha sim uh. <verse eid="MRK 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 16:16" />Hutukhaw isehla a zum ih baptisma a cotu cu rundam an i thok. Asinain a zum lotu cu hutukhaw isehla thiam lo coter a i thok. <verse eid="MRK 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 16:17" />Cule a zumtu pawl cu hi hminsitnak pawl tuah theinak huham pek an i thok: ka hmin in khawsia an dawi thei thok; ṭon thar in an ṭon thok; <verse eid="MRK 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 16:18" />an kut thawn rul an la thok; thihsi an din hmanah an zangkhaw a poi thok lo; mifak cungah an kut an suang thok ih mifak cu an dam thok,” tiah a ti.<verse eid="MRK 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesuh Vancung ah Laksonak</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 24:50-53">Luka 24.50–53</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:9-11">Forhthlah 1.9–11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 16:19" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16.19 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 1:9-11">Forh 1.9–11</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Cun an sinih thu a sip colh hnukah, Bawipa Jesuh cu van ah lakin a um ih Pathian vorh la kap ah a to. <verse eid="MRK 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 16:20" />Cule dungthluntu pawl cu an feh ih khuazakip ah thu an sim; Bawipa cu an sinah ṭuan a ṭuan ih, mangbangza an tuahmi nih an thusim mi hi a dik, tih a langter.]</para>
  <para style="ms" vid="MRK 16:20">Marka Thuthangṭha Netnak Tawi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16.20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">A hrekkhat kutngan cabu pawl le khuahlan Baibal lehmi pawl sungah cu netnak sau an betmi sungah hivai Thuthangṭha netnak tawi hi a um (afate 9–20).</char></note></para>
  <para style="mr" vid="MRK 16:20">
    <ref loc="MRK 16:9-10">16.9–10</ref></para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 16:20">[ <verse eid="MRK 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" pubnumber="[9]" sid="MRK 16:21" /> Numi pawl cu Peter le a rualpi pawl sinah an feh ih an theihmi thuhla cu a tawinak in an sim. <verse eid="MRK 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" pubnumber="[10]" sid="MRK 16:22" /> Cuhnukah Jesuh ama rori nih kumkhua rundamnak thu le thu thianghlim cu nisuahnak in nitlaknak tiang a dungthluntu pawl hmangin a sim.]<verse eid="MRK 16:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 16" />
</usx>